":"pdf-analyzer"},"description":{"zh":"PDF分析器是一个基于VT Code的语义编码AI智能工具，用于分析和优化PDF文件","ja":"PDF Analyzerは、VT CodeベースのセマンティックコーディングAIエージェントであり、PDFファイルを分析および最適化するために使用されます","ko":"PDF 분석기는 VT Code 기반의 의미 분석 AI 에이전트로 PDF 파일을 분석 및 최적화하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"El analizador de PDF es un agente de codificación semántica que opera en la terminal, permitiendo una análisis avanzado de documentos PDF","fr":"L''analyseur de PDF est un agent de codage sémantique qui fonctionne dans le terminal, permettant une analyse avancée de documents PDF","de":"Der PDF-Analyse-Tool ist ein semantisches Codierungsagent, der in der Terminal arbeitet, um eine erweiterte Analyse von PDF-Dokumenten zu ermöglichen","pt":"O Analisador de PDF é uma ferramenta de código semântico que ajuda desenvolvedores a trabalhar com PDFs no terminal, utilizando VT Code","ru":"ИИ Агент для анализа PDF - это семантический код в терминале, который помогает разработчикам работать с PDF, используя VT Code","ar":"عامل تحليل PDF هو أداة ترميز семантиكي تساعد المطورين على العمل مع ملفات PDF في الطرفية، باستخدام VT Code","en":"VT Code - Semantic coding agent in the terminal"},"definition":{"en":"VT Code - Semantic coding agent in the terminal"},"features":{"zh":["支持VT Code语义编码","分析PDF文件结构和内容","优化PDF文件大小和质量","支持多种PDF文件格式","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["VT Codeセマンティックコーディングをサポート","PDFファイルの構造と内容を分析","PDFファイルのサイズと品質を最適化","複数のPDFファイル形式をサポート","使用と統合が容易"],"ko":["VT Code 의미 분석 코딩 지원","PDF 파일 구조와 내용 분석","PDF 파일 크기와 품질 최적화","여러 PDF 파일 형식 지원","사용과 통합이 쉬움"],"es":["Análisis de PDF en la terminal","Codificación semántica avanzada","Compatibilidad con VT Code","Interfaz de línea de comandos","Soporte para documentos PDF complejos"],"fr":["Analyse de PDF dans le terminal","Codage sémantique avancé","Compatibilité avec VT Code","Interface de ligne de commande","Prise en charge de documents PDF complexes"],"de":["PDF-Analyse im Terminal","Erweitertes semantisches Codieren","Kompatibilität mit VT Code","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle","Unterstützung für komplexe PDF-Dokumente"],"pt":["Análise de PDFs no terminal","Código semântico com VT Code","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Processamento de arquivos PDF","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo"],"ru":["Анализ PDF в терминале","Семантический код с VT Code","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Обработка файлов PDF","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов"],"ar":["تحليل ملفات PDF في الطرفية","ترميز семантиكي مع VT Code","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","معالجة ملفات PDF","دعم عدة صيغ ملفات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用PDF分析器","什么是PDF分析器","PDF分析器替代品","PDF分析器与其他工具的比较","PDF分析器安装指南","PDF分析器设置教程","PDF优化工具","PDF分析软件"],"ja":["PDF Analyzerの使用方法","PDF Analyzerとは","PDF Analyzerの代替品","PDF Analyzerと他のツールの比較","PDF Analyzerのインストールガイド","PDF Analyzerの設定チュートリアル","PDF最適化ツール","PDF分析ソフトウェア"],"ko":["PDF 분석기 사용법","PDF 분석기란","PDF 분석기 대안","PDF 분석기와 다른 도구의 비교","PDF 분석기 설치 가이드","PDF 분석기 설정 튜토리얼","PDF 최적화 도구","PDF 분석 소프트웨어"],"es":["cómo usar el analizador de PDF","qué es un agente de codificación semántica","alternativas al analizador de PDF","analizador de PDF vs otros herramientas","instalación del analizador de PDF","guía de configuración del analizador de PDF"],"fr":["comment utiliser l''analyseur de PDF","qu''est-ce qu''un agent de codage sémantique","alternatives à l''analyseur de PDF","analyseur de PDF vs autres outils","installation de l''analyseur de PDF","guide de configuration de l''analyseur de PDF"],"de":["wie man den PDF-Analyse-Tool verwendet","was ist ein semantischer Codierungsagent","alternativen zum PDF-Analyse-Tool","PDF-Analyse-Tool vs andere Tools","installation des PDF-Analyse-Tools","konfigurationsanleitung für das PDF-Analyse-Tool"],"pt":["analisador de pdf","ferramenta de código semântico","vt code","desenvolvimento de software","trabalhar com pdfs","como usar analisador de pdf","analisador de pdf alternative","analisador de pdf vs competidor"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для анализа pdf","семантический код в терминале","vt code","разработка программного обеспечения","работа с pdf","как использовать ИИ Агент для анализа pdf","ИИ Агент для анализа pdf альтернатива","ИИ Агент для анализа pdf vs конкурент"],"ar":["عامل تحليل pdf","أداة ترميز семантиكي","vt code","تطوير البرمجيات","العمل مع ملفات pdf","كيفية استخدام عامل تحليل pdf","عامل تحليل pdf بديل","عامل تحليل pdf مقابل المنافس"]}},"owner":"vinhnx","repo":"VTCode","repoPath":"vinhnx/VTCode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T01:32:52.499Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf-analyzer","description":"Analyze PDF, DOCX, and spreadsheet documents using vision models. Converts documents to images and extracts insights with layout preservation. Uses VT Codes native document processor (no container skills required).","version":"1.0.0","tags":["document","pdf","docx","excel","vision","vtcode-native"],"bodyPreview":"# PDF/DOCX/Spreadsheet Analyzer\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides OpenAI-style document processing capabilities, converting PDFs, Word documents, and spreadsheets into rendered images for vision model analysis. This approach preserves layout, formatting, tables, and visual elements that would be lost in traditional text extraction.\n\n**Inspired by:** OpenAI''s implementation in ChatGPT''s Code Interpreter (per Simon Willison''s blog post, Dec 2025)\n\n## Supported Formats\n\n- **PDF**: Multi-page docume","body":"# PDF/DOCX/Spreadsheet Analyzer\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides OpenAI-style document processing capabilities, converting PDFs, Word documents, and spreadsheets into rendered images for vision model analysis. This approach preserves layout, formatting, tables, and visual elements that would be lost in traditional text extraction.\n\n**Inspired by:** OpenAI''s implementation in ChatGPT''s Code Interpreter (per Simon Willison''s blog post, Dec 2025)\n\n## Supported Formats\n\n- **PDF**: Multi-page documents, converted page-by-page to PNGs\n- **DOCX/DOC**: Word documents with full formatting preservation\n- **XLSX/XLS/CSV**: Spreadsheets rendered as visual tables\n- **Images**: Direct analysis (PNG, JPG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, TIFF)\n\n## Usage in VT Code\n\n### Basic Document Analysis\n\n```bash\n# List available skills\nvtcode list-skills\n\n# Load the skill\nvtcode skills load pdf-analyzer\n\n# In VT Code chat:\n/skills load pdf-analyzer\n```\n\n### Analyzing Documents\n\n```\nUser: Analyze this PDF report and summarize the key findings\nAssistant: I''ll use the PDF analyzer skill to process this document with vision-based analysis.\n\n[Skill processes document, converts to images, analyzes with vision model]\n\nThe document contains:\n1. Executive summary on page 1 highlighting Q3 revenue growth\n2. Detailed financial tables on pages 3-4 showing 15% YoY growth\n3. Charts illustrating market expansion opportunities\n4. Risk assessment section on page 7\n\nKey insights:\n- Revenue increased from $2.1M to $2.4M (14.3% growth)\n- New customer acquisition up 23%\n- Challenges noted in supply chain efficiency\n```\n\n### Processing Spreadsheets\n\n```\nUser: Review this Excel file and identify any anomalies in the sales data\nAssistant: Let me analyze the spreadsheet using vision-based processing to preserve the table structure and formatting.\n\n[Skill renders spreadsheet as image, detects structure, analyzes values]\n\nFindings:\n- Row 42: Sales amount of $50,000 with no corresponding customer ID (potential data entry error)\n- Column E: Several negative values that may indicate returns or refunds\n- Week of 2025-03-15: Unusual 300% spike in orders (verify with sales team)\n- Conditional formatting shows 12 overdue payments highlighted in red\n```\n\n### Document Comparison\n\n```\nUser: Compare these two contract versions and highlight the changes\nAssistant: I''ll process both documents using vision analysis to detect textual and formatting changes.\n\n[Skill processes both documents, compares rendered pages]\n\nDifferences detected:\n- Section 3.2: Payment terms changed from \"Net 30\" to \"Net 15\"\n- Clause 7.1: Liability cap increased from $100k to $250k\n- Page 5: New confidentiality provision added\n- Header formatting: Company logo position adjusted\n```\n\n## Technical Implementation\n\n### Architecture\n\n```\nDocument → Renderer → PNG Images → Vision Model → Analysis → Insights\n```\n\n1. **Document Loading**: Supports PDF, DOCX, XLSX, CSV, and image formats\n2. **Rendering**: Converts pages/sheets to high-quality PNG images (150 DPI default)\n3. **Vision Processing**: Sends images to vision-enabled LLM for analysis\n4. **Text Extraction**: Optionally runs OCR for searchable text layer\n5. **Insight Generation**: Combines visual analysis with extracted content\n\n### Key Features\n\n**Layout Preservation:**\n- Tables maintain row/column structure\n- Charts and graphs remain visually intact\n- Formatting (bold, italic, colors) is preserved\n- Page structure and flow are maintained\n\n**Multi-page Processing:**\n- Automatic pagination for long documents\n- Cross-page context awareness\n- Page number references in analysis\n\n**Vision Model Integration:**\n- Sends rendered images to Gemini/Claude/GPT-4 vision models\n- Maintains spatial relationships in analysis\n- Extracts both textual and visual information\n\n### Token Efficiency\n\n- Images compressed to optimal size for vision models\n- Smart page selection for long documents\n- Caching of rendered pages\n- Configurable DPI (75/150/300) based on detail requirements\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n```bash\n# Document processing\nexport VT_CODE_DOC_DPI=150          # Rendering DPI (default: 150)\nexport VT_CODE_DOC_MAX_PAGES=50     # Max pages per document (default: 50)\nexport VT_CODE_DOC_ENABLE_OCR=true  # Enable OCR fallback (default: true)\n\n# Vision model selection\nexport VT_CODE_VISION_MODEL=gemini-2.5-pro  # Model for document analysis\n```\n\n### VTCode Configuration\n\n```toml\n[skills.pdf-analyzer]\nenabled = true\ndpi = 150\nmax_pages = 50\nenable_ocr = true\nvision_model = \"gemini-2.5-pro\"\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Financial Report Analysis\n\n```\nUser: Analyze Q3_Financial_Report.pdf and give me the key metrics\n\nAssistant: Processing the financial report using vision-based analysis...\n\nKey Metrics Extracted:\n• Total Revenue: $2.4M (Q3 2025)\n• Gross Margin: 68%\n• Operating Expenses: $1.2M\n• Net Income: $432K (18% margin)\n• Cash Flow: +$156K from operations\n\nTrends:\n• Revenue up 14.3% vs Q2\n• Margin improvement of 2.1 percentage points\n• Customer acquisition cost decreased 8%\n\n[Tables and charts referenced by page number]\n```\n\n### Example 2: Contract Review\n\n```\nUser: Review this NDA and highlight any unusual clauses\n\nAssistant: Analyzing the Non-Disclosure Agreement...\n\nContract Review Summary:\n✓ Standard confidentiality provisions\n✓ Reasonable duration (2 years)\n⚠️  Unusual clause found: Section 5.3 - \"Perpetual confidentiality for trade secrets\"\n⚠️  Geographic scope: Worldwide (typical, but confirm if appropriate)\n✓ Standard exclusions for public information\n\nRecommendation: The perpetual trade secret clause is enforceable but consider:\n- Defining \"trade secrets\" more specifically\n- Adding a severability provision\n```\n\n### Example 3: Research Paper Analysis\n\n```\nUser: Summarize this research paper and extract the methodology\n\nAssistant: Processing the research paper with vision analysis...\n\nPaper Summary:\n\"Advanced Techniques in Machine Learning Optimization\"\nAuthors: Smith et al. (2025)\n\nAbstract Summary:\nThe paper presents a novel optimization algorithm that improves convergence\nspeed by 40% compared to Adam optimizer...\n\nMethodology (from pages 3-5):\n1. Dataset: CIFAR-10, ImageNet, and custom benchmarks\n2. Architecture: ResNet-50, ViT-B/16\n3. Hyperparameters: Learning rate 1e-3, batch size 256\n4. Novel contribution: Adaptive momentum scheduling\n\nResults (pages 6-7):\n• 40% faster convergence vs baseline\n• 2.3% accuracy improvement on ImageNet\n• Robust to hyperparameter variations\n\n[Referenced figures: Fig 2 (convergence curve), Fig 4 (accuracy comparison)]\n```\n\n## Advanced Usage\n\n### Batch Processing\n\n```bash\n# Process multiple documents\nfor doc in *.pdf; do\n  vtcode ask \"Analyze $doc and save summary to ${doc%.pdf}_summary.txt\"\ndone\n```\n\n### Integration with CLI\n\n```bash\n# Process document and extract specific information\nvtcode skills load pdf-analyzer\nvtcode ask \"Extract all email addresses from contract.pdf\"\n```\n\n### Custom Vision Prompts\n\n```\nUser: Analyze this document focusing only on financial data and risks\n\nAssistant: I''ll use a custom vision prompt to focus specifically on financial information and risk factors...\n\n[Custom prompt guides model to focus on specific elements]\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n**Document too large:**\n```\nError: Document exceeds maximum page limit (50 pages)\nSolution: Split document or increase VT_CODE_DOC_MAX_PAGES\n```\n\n**Vision model unavailable:**\n```\nError: Vision model not configured\nSolution: Set VT_CODE_VISION_MODEL or use default Gemini vision model\n```\n\n**Rendering fails:**\n```\nError: Unable to render document\nSolution: Verify file format is supported and not corrupted\n```\n\n### Debug Mode\n\n```bash\nexport VT_CODE_DEBUG_DOCUMENTS=true\nvtcode skills load pdf-analyzer\nvtcode ask \"Analyze document.pdf\"\n# Will show detailed rendering and processing logs\n```\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n1. **Use appropriate DPI**: 150 DPI is good for most documents\n2. **Limit page range**: Process only relevant pages for large documents\n3. **Batch processing**: Process multiple documents in parallel\n4. **Cache results**: Reuse processed documents when possible\n5. **Choose efficient vision models**: Gemini 2.5 Flash for speed, Pro for detail\n\n## Security Considerations\n\n- Documents processed locally, not sent to external services\n- Vision model calls use standard LLM APIs with encryption\n- Temporary files cleaned up after processing\n- No document content stored permanently\n\n## License\n\nMIT License - See VTCode main repository for details."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T01:57:40.249Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Analysis Agents needing advanced document processing capabilities for PDF, DOCX, and spreadsheet formats","zh":"适合需要高级文档处理功能的AI分析代理，支持PDF、DOCX和电子表格格式","ja":"AI分析エージェントが高度なドキュメント処理機能を必要とする場合に適しています。PDF、DOCX、スプレッドシート形式をサポート","ko":"고급 문서 처리 기능이 필요한 AI 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다. PDF, DOCX, 스프레드시트 형식을 지원합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de IA que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de documentos avanzadas para PDF, DOCX y formatos de hoja de cálculo","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse d''IA nécessitant des capacités de traitement de documents avancées pour les formats PDF, DOCX et feuille de calcul","de":"Perfekt für AI-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Dokumentenverarbeitungsfunktionen für PDF, DOCX und Tabellenkalkulationsformate benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de análise de IA que precisam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de documentos para PDF, DOCX e formatos de planilha","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности обработки документов для PDF, DOCX и форматов электронных таблиц","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلىقدرات متقدمة لمعالجة المستندات لتنسيقات PDF و DOCX والجداول"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert PDFs, Word documents, and spreadsheets into rendered images for vision model analysis, preserving layout, formatting, tables, and visual elements using OpenAI-style document processing, supporting formats like PDF and DOCX","zh":"使代理能够将PDF、Word文档和电子表格转换为渲染图像，以进行视觉模型分析，保留布局、格式、表格和视觉元素，使用OpenAI风格的文档处理，支持PDF和DOCX等格式","ja":"エージェントがPDF、Word文書、スプレッドシートをレンダリングされた画像に変換して視覚モデル分析を行えるようにし、レイアウト、フォーマット、表、視覚要素を保ち、OpenAIスタイルのドキュメント処理をサポートし、PDFやDOCXなどの形式をサポート","ko":"에이전트가 PDF, 워드 문서, 스프레드시트를 렌더링된 이미지로 변환하여 비전 모델 분석을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 레이아웃, 형식, 표, 시각적 요소를 보존하고 OpenAI 스타일의 문서 처리를 지원하며 PDF 및 DOCX와 같은 형식을 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir PDF, documentos de Word y hojas de cálculo en imágenes renderizadas para el análisis del modelo de visión, conservando el diseño, el formato, las tablas y los elementos visuales mediante el procesamiento de documentos de estilo OpenAI, compatible con formatos como PDF y DOCX","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des PDF, des documents Word et des feuilles de calcul en images rendues pour l''analyse du modèle de vision, en préservant la mise en page, le format, les tableaux et les éléments visuels à l''aide du traitement de documents de style OpenAI, prenant en charge des formats tels que PDF et DOCX","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, PDF-, Word-Dokumente und Tabellenkalkulationen in gerenderte Bilder für die Analyse des Vision-Modells umzuwandeln, wobei die Layouts, Formatierungen, Tabellen und visuellen Elemente mithilfe der OpenAI-Style-Dokumentenverarbeitung erhalten bleiben, die Formate wie PDF und DOCX unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter PDFs, documentos do Word e planilhas em imagens renderizadas para análise de modelos de visão, preservando o layout, formatação, tabelas e elementos visuais usando o processamento de documentos no estilo OpenAI, com suporte a formatos como PDF e DOCX","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конвертировать PDF, документы Word и электронные таблицы в отображаемые изображения для анализа моделей зрения, сохраняя макет, форматирование, таблицы и визуальные элементы с использованием обработки документов в стиле OpenAI, поддерживающей форматы seperti PDF и DOCX","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل مستندات PDF و Word والجداول إلى صور معالَجة للتحليل แบบ نموذج الرؤية، مع الحفاظ على التصميم والتنسيق والجداول والعناصر المرئية باستخدام معالجة المستندات بالنمط OpenAI، ودعم تنسيقات مثل PDF و DOCX"},"useCases":{"en":["Converting multi-page PDF documents for analysis","Preserving table and visual element formatting in spreadsheets","Analyzing DOCX files with complex layouts"],"zh":["将多页PDF文档转换为分析","在电子表格中保留表格和视觉元素的格式","分析具有复杂布局的DOCX文件"],"ja":["複数ページのPDF文書を分析用に変換する","スプレッドシートで表や視覚要素のフォーマットを保つ","複雑なレイアウトを持つDOCXファイルを分析する"],"ko":["분석을 위해 여러 페이지의 PDF 문서를 변환하는 것","스프레드시트에서 표 및 시각적 요소의 형식을 유지하는 것","복잡한 레이아웃을 가진 DOCX 파일을 분석하는 것"],"es":["Convertir documentos PDF de varias páginas para análisis","Conservar el formato de tabla y elemento visual en hojas de cálculo","Analizar archivos DOCX con diseños complejos"],"fr":["Convertir des documents PDF à plusieurs pages pour analyse","Conserver le formatage de tableau et d''élément visuel dans les feuilles de calcul","Analyser des fichiers DOCX avec des mises en page complexes"],"de":["Umwandeln von PDF-Dokumenten mit mehreren Seiten für die Analyse","Erhaltung des Tabellen- und visuellen Elementformatierungs in Tabellenkalkulationen","Analyse von DOCX-Dateien mit komplexen Layouts"],"pt":["Conversão de documentos PDF de várias páginas para análise","Preservação do formato de tabelas e elementos visuais em planilhas","Análise de arquivos DOCX com layouts complexos"],"ru":["Преобразование многостраничных документов PDF для анализа","Сохранение форматирования таблиц и визуальных элементов в электронных таблицах","Анализ файлов DOCX с сложными макетами"],"ar":["تحويل مستندات PDF متعددة الصفحات للتحليل","الحفاظ على تنسيق الجداول والعناصر المرئية في الجداول","تحليل ملفات DOCX ذات التصاميم المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires vision model capabilities for image analysis","Supports specific file formats like PDF, DOCX, and spreadsheets"],"zh":["需要视觉模型功能来分析图像","仅支持特定的文件格式，如PDF、DOCX和电子表格"],"ja":["画像分析に視覚モデル機能が必要","特定のファイル形式のみをサポートする、たとえばPDF、DOCX、スプレッドシート"],"ko":["이미지 분석을 위해 비전 모델 기능이 필요합니다","특정 파일 형식만을 지원합니다. 예를 들어 PDF, DOCX, 스프레드시트"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de modelo de visión para análisis de imágenes","Admite formatos de archivo específicos como PDF, DOCX y hojas de cálculo"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de modèle de vision pour l''analyse d''images","Prend en c