.aget/evolution وتحسين أداء الوكلاء الذكية"},"definition":{"en":"aget-check-evolution is a foundation archetype for AGET agents that implements 35 CAP-* capabilities to monitor the health of the .aget/evolution/ directory.","zh":"aget-check-evolution是一种用于AI工具健康监测的技术，提供自我诊断能力","ja":"aget-check-evolutionは、AIエージェントのヘルスチェックに使用される技術で、自己診断能力を提供します","ko":"aget-check-evolution은 AI 에이전트의 건강 상태 확인에 사용되는 기술로, 자체 진단 능력을 제공합니다","es":"aget-check-evolution es una herramienta de diagnóstico para AGET que evalúa la salud del directorio de evolución","fr":"aget-check-evolution est un outil de diagnostic pour AGET qui évalue la santé du répertoire d''évolution","de":"aget-check-evolution ist ein Diagnosetool für AGET, das die Gesundheit des Evolution-Verzeichnisses bewertet","pt":"O aget-check-evolution é um modelo de trabalhador que implementa 35 capacidades CAP-* para monitorar a saúde do diretório .aget/evolution","ru":"aget-check-evolution - это шаблон рабочего, который реализует 35 возможностей CAP-* для мониторинга каталога .aget/evolution","ar":"aget-check-evolution هو نموذج عامل يطبق 35 قدرة CAP-* لمراقبة صحة مجلد .aget/evolution"},"features":{"en":["Performs file inventory using find and wc commands","Checks file counts and types, including Markdown files (.md)","Monitors disk usage to ensure optimal performance","Provides self-diagnostic capability for AGET agents","Implements 35 CAP-* capabilities for comprehensive monitoring"],"zh":["文件计数和类型检查","命名约定验证","磁盘使用情况监测","自我诊断能力","支持多种文件扩展名检查"],"ja":["ファイル数とタイプのチェック","命名規則の検証","ディスク使用状況の監視","自己診断能力","複数のファイル拡張子をサポート"],"ko":["파일 수와 유형 확인","명명 규칙 검증","디스크 사용량 모니터링","자체 진단 능력","다수의 파일 확장자 지원"],"es":["Verificación de la cantidad de archivos en el directorio de evolución","Comprobación de los tipos de archivos y convenciones de nombre","Monitoreo del uso de disco en el directorio de evolución","Implementación de 35 capacidades CAP-*","Compatibilidad con la línea de comandos (CLI) para ejecución de comandos"],"fr":["Vérification du nombre de fichiers dans le répertoire d''évolution","Vérification des types de fichiers et des conventions de nommage","Surveillance de l''utilisation du disque dans le répertoire d''évolution","Mise en œuvre de 35 capacités CAP-*","Compatibilité avec la ligne de commande (CLI) pour l''exécution de commandes"],"de":["Überprüfung der Anzahl der Dateien im Evolution-Verzeichnis","Überprüfung der Dateitypen und Namenskonventionen","Überwachung der Disknutzung im Evolution-Verzeichnis","Implementierung von 35 CAP-*-Fähigkeiten","Kompatibilität mit der Kommandozeile (CLI) für die Ausführung von Befehlen"],"pt":["Monitoramento de arquivo e diretórios","Verificação de nomeação e convenções de arquivo","Análise de uso de disco","Implementação de 35 capacidades CAP-*","Autodiagnóstico para agentes AGET","Compatibilidade com CLI"],"ru":["Мониторинг файлов и каталогов","Проверка наименования и конвенций файлов","Анализ использования диска","Реализация 35 возможностей CAP-*","Самодиагностика для ИИ Агентов","Совместимость с CLI"],"ar":["مراقبة الملفات والمجلدات","التحقق من命اء وتوافق الملفات","تحليل استخدام القرص","تنفيذ 35 قدرة CAP-*","التشخيص الذاتي للوكلاء الذكية","التوافق مع CLI"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution setup guide","aget-check-evolution alternative","aget-check-evolution vs agent monitoring tools","what is aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution install","monitoring AI agent health","AGET agent performance optimization","directory health monitoring"],"zh":["AI工具健康监测","aget-check-evolution设置","AIエージェント自我诊断","文件计数和类型检查","磁盘使用情况监测","AI开发工具"],"ja":["AIエージェントのヘルスチェック","aget-check-evolution設定","AIエージェントの自己診断","ファイル数とタイプのチェック","ディスク使用状況の監視","AI開発ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 건강 상태 확인","aget-check-evolution 설정","AI 에이전트 자체 진단","파일 수와 유형 확인","디스크 사용량 모니터링","AI 개발 도구"],"es":["aget-check-evolution","herramientas de diagnóstico para AGET","monitoreo de directorios","verificación de archivos","uso de disco","CAP-* capabilities","línea de comandos","agentes de AI","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["aget-check-evolution","outils de diagnostic pour AGET","surveillance de répertoires","vérification de fichiers","utilisation du disque","CAP-* capabilities","ligne de commande","agents d''IA","outils de développement"],"de":["aget-check-evolution","Diagnosetools für AGET","Überwachung von Verzeichnissen","Überprüfung von Dateien","Disknutzung","CAP-*-Fähigkeiten","Kommandozeile","KI-Agents","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["aget-check-evolution","monitoramento de diretórios","autodiagnóstico","agentes AGET","CAP-*","CLI","desenvolvimento de software","otimização de desempenho","saúde do diretório"],"ru":["aget-check-evolution","мониторинг каталогов","самодиагностика","ИИ Агенты","CAP-*","CLI","разработка программного обеспечения","оптимизация производительности","здоровье каталога"],"ar":["aget-check-evolution","مراقبة المجلدات","التشخيص الذاتي","الوكلاء الذكية","CAP-*","CLI","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين الأداء","صحة المجلد"]}},"owner":"aget-framework","repo":"template-worker-aget","repoPath":"aget-framework/template-worker-aget","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.776Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aget-check-evolution","description":"Monitor .aget/evolution/ directory health. Validates file counts, naming conventions, disk usage, and returns health status with alerts on anomalies.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# /aget-check-evolution\n\nMonitor the health of the `.aget/evolution/` directory by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage.\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide self-diagnostic capability for AGET agents to assess their evolution directory health without supervisor intervention.\n\n## Execution\n\nWhen invoked, perform these checks:\n\n### 1. File Inventory\n\n```bash\n# Count total files\nfind .aget/evolution -type f | wc -l\n\n# Count by extension\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.md\" | wc -l","body":"# /aget-check-evolution\n\nMonitor the health of the `.aget/evolution/` directory by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage.\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide self-diagnostic capability for AGET agents to assess their evolution directory health without supervisor intervention.\n\n## Execution\n\nWhen invoked, perform these checks:\n\n### 1. File Inventory\n\n```bash\n# Count total files\nfind .aget/evolution -type f | wc -l\n\n# Count by extension\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.md\" | wc -l\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.json\" | wc -l\nfind .aget/evolution -type f ! -name \"*.md\" ! -name \"*.json\" | wc -l\n```\n\n### 2. Naming Convention Check\n\nValid L-doc pattern: `L###_*.md` (e.g., `L588_skill_invocation_control_semantics.md`)\n\n```bash\n# Count valid L-doc names\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"L[0-9][0-9][0-9]_*.md\" | wc -l\n\n# Find non-conforming files (excluding index.json)\nfind .aget/evolution -type f ! -name \"L[0-9][0-9][0-9]_*.md\" ! -name \"index.json\" ! -name \"README.md\"\n```\n\n### 3. Disk Usage\n\n```bash\ndu -sh .aget/evolution\n```\n\n### 4. Index Integrity\n\nCheck that `index.json` exists and is valid JSON:\n\n```bash\ntest -f .aget/evolution/index.json && jq empty .aget/evolution/index.json 2>/dev/null && echo \"valid\" || echo \"invalid\"\n```\n\n## Thresholds\n\n| Metric | OK | WARN | CRITICAL |\n|--------|-----|------|----------|\n| Total files | <500 | 500-750 | >750 |\n| Non-standard files | 0-10 | 11-50 | >50 |\n| Disk size | <10MB | 10-25MB | >25MB |\n| Index integrity | valid | - | invalid |\n\n**Note**: Thresholds inherited from supervisor defaults. Research AGET baseline (2026-02-08): 94 files, 800K - well within OK range.\n\n## Output Format\n\nReport the following:\n\n```\n=== /aget-check-evolution ===\n\nDirectory: .aget/evolution/\n\nFile Counts:\n  Total:     [count]\n  L-docs:    [count] (.md matching L###_*.md)\n  Index:     [1 if exists, 0 otherwise]\n  Other:     [count] (non-conforming)\n\nDisk Usage: [size]\n\nIndex Status: [valid/invalid/missing]\n\nNon-Conforming Files:\n  [list any files not matching expected patterns]\n\nHealth Status: [OK | WARN | CRITICAL]\nAlerts:\n  [list any threshold violations]\n```\n\n## Health Status Logic\n\n```\nIF index invalid OR index missing:\n  CRITICAL\nELIF total_files > 750 OR disk > 25MB OR non_standard > 50:\n  CRITICAL\nELIF total_files > 500 OR disk > 10MB OR non_standard > 10:\n  WARN\nELSE:\n  OK\n```\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **C1**: Read-only operation. Never modify files.\n- **C2**: Report ALL findings, even if status is OK.\n- **C3**: List non-conforming files by name for actionability.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `/aget-check-sessions` - Sessions directory health\n- `/aget-check-kb` - Knowledge base health\n- `/aget-record-lesson` - Capture findings as L-docs\n\n## Traceability\n\n| Link | Reference |\n|------|-----------|\n| POC | POC-017 |\n| Project | PROJECT_PLAN_AGET_UNIVERSAL_SKILLS.md |\n| Source | Fleet Skill Deployment Report (supervisor) |\n| Baseline | 94 files, 800K (2026-02-08) |\n\n---\n\n*aget-check-evolution v1.0.0*\n*Category: Monitoring*\n*POC-017 Phase 1*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:13:18.222Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AGET Agents needing advanced self-diagnostic capabilities for evolution directory health assessment.","zh":"适用于需要高级自诊断功能以评估进化目录健康的 AGET 代理。","ja":"AGET エージェントが進化ディレクトリのヘルス評価のための高度なセルフ診断機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"진화 디렉토리 상태 평가를 위한 고급 자기 진단 기능이 필요한 AGET 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes AGET que necesitan capacidades de autodiagnóstico avanzadas para la evaluación de la salud del directorio de evolución.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents AGET ayant besoin de capacités d''auto-diagnostic avancées pour l''évaluation de la santé du répertoire d''évolution.","de":"Perfekt für AGET-Agents, die erweiterte Selbst-diagnose-Funktionen für die Bewertung der Verzeichnisgesundheit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes AGET que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de autodiagnóstico para avaliação da saúde do diretório de evolução.","ru":"Идеально для агентов AGET, которым необходимы расширенные возможности самоанализа для оценки состояния директории эволюции.","ar":"مثالي لعميل AGET الذين يحتاجون إلى возможات ذاتية التشخيص المتقدمة لتقييم حالة دليل التطور."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to monitor file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage within the `.aget/evolution/` directory, leveraging `find` and `wc` commands for precise filesystem analysis.","zh":"使代理能够监控 `.aget/evolution/` 目录中的文件数量、类型、命名约定和磁盘使用情况，利用 `find` 和 `wc` 命令进行精确的文件系统分析。","ja":"`find` と `wc` コマンドを使用して、`.aget/evolution/` ディレクトリ内のファイル数、タイプ、命名規則、およびディスク使用状況を監視できるようにエージェントを有効にします。","ko":"에이전트가 `.aget/evolution/` 디렉토리 내의 파일 수, 유형, 명명 규칙 및 디스크 사용량을 모니터링할 수 있도록 하며, `find` 및 `wc` 명령을 사용하여 정확한 파일 시스템 분석을 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes monitorear los recuentos de archivos, tipos, convenciones de nomenclatura y uso de disco dentro del directorio `.aget/evolution/`, aprovechando los comandos `find` y `wc` para un análisis de sistema de archivos preciso.","fr":"Permet aux agents de surveiller les comptes de fichiers, les types, les conventions de dénomination et l''utilisation du disque à l''intérieur du répertoire `.aget/evolution/`, en exploitant les commandes `find` et `wc` pour une analyse de système de fichiers précise.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Dateizahlen, -typen, Benennungskonventionen und Plattenplatz innerhalb des Verzeichnisses `.aget/evolution/` zu überwachen, indem es die Befehle `find` und `wc` für eine präzise Dateisystemanalyse nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a monitorar contagens de arquivos, tipos, convenções de nomenclatura e uso de disco dentro do diretório `.aget/evolution/`, utilizando os comandos `find` e `wc` para análise de sistema de arquivos precisa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отслеживать количество файлов, типы, соглашения об именовании и использование диска внутри директории `.aget/evolution/`, используя команды `find` и `wc` для точного анализа файловой системы.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على مراقبة عدد الملفات وأنواعها وأساليب التسمية واستخدام القرص داخل دليل `.aget/evolution/` ، باستخدام أوامر `find` و `wc` للتحليل الدقيق لنظام الملفات."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring evolution directory health","Debugging file inventory discrepancies","Optimizing disk usage for efficient agent operation"],"zh":["监控进化目录健康","调试文件库存差异","优化磁盘使用以实现高效的代理操作"],"ja":["進化ディレクトリのヘルス状態を監視する","ファイルインベントリの差異をデバッグする","エージェントの効率的な動作のためのディスク使用量を最適化する"],"ko":["진화 디렉토리 상태 모니터링","파일 재고 불일치 디버깅","에이전트의 효율적인 작동을 위한 디스크 사용량 최적화"],"es":["Supervisión de la salud del directorio de evolución","Depuración de discrepancias en el inventario de archivos","Optimización del uso de disco para una operación de agente eficiente"],"fr":["Supervision de la santé du répertoire d''évolution","Débogage des écarts d''inventaire de fichiers","Optimisation de l''utilisation du disque pour une opération d''agent efficace"],"de":["Überwachung der Verzeichnisgesundheit","Fehlerbehebung bei Abweichungen im Dateibestand","Optimierung der Plattenplatznutzung für einen effizienten Agentenbetrieb"],"pt":["Monitoramento da saúde do diretório de evolução","Depuração de discrepâncias no inventário de arquivos","Otimização do uso de disco para operação eficiente do agente"],"ru":["Мониторинг состояния директории эволюции","Отладка несоответствий в инвентаре файлов","Оптимизация использования диска для эффективной работы агента"],"ar":["مراقبة حالة دليل التطور","تصحيح أخطاء في جرد الملفات","تحسين استخدام القرص من أجل تشغيل وكيل فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access to `.aget/evolution/` directory","Limited to monitoring specific file types (e.g., `.md` extensions)"],"zh":["需要对 `.aget/evolution/` 目录具有文件系统访问权限","仅限于监控特定文件类型（例如 `.md` 扩展名）"],"ja":["`.aget/evolution/` ディレクトリへのファイルシステムアクセスが必要","特定のファイルタイプ（例： `.md` 拡張子）のみを監視できる"],"ko":["`.aget/evolution/` 디렉토리 파일 시스템에 액세스해야 함","특정 파일 유형(예: `.md` 확장자)만 모니터링할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos del directorio `.aget/evolution/`","Limitado a la supervisión de tipos de archivos específicos (por ejemplo, extensiones `.md`)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers du répertoire `.aget/evolution/`","Limité à la surveillance de types de fichiers spécifiques (par exemple, extensions `.md`)"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem des Verzeichnisses `.aget/evolution/`","Begrenzt auf die Überwachung spezifischer Dateitypen (z.B. `.md`-Erweiterungen)"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos do diretório `.aget/evolution/`","Limitado ao monitoramento de tipos de arquivos específicos (por exemplo, extensões `.md`)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе директории `.aget/evolution/`","Ограничен мониторингом определенных типов файлов (например, расширений `.md`)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لدليل `.aget/evolution/`","محدود بمراقبة أنواع ملفات معينة (على سبيل المثال ، الامتدادات `.md`)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"62225f596bebfa5e6aa19d9cc2fdf738236aaf21bb057aece1bfe1c5b54b6cb3","qualityScore":56}');
