des demandes d''extraction dans ArcticDB","de":"Review-pr ist ein Tool zur Code-Überprüfung, das GitHub Actions nutzt, um die Überprüfung von Pull-Requests in ArcticDB zu automatisieren","pt":"O review-pr é uma ferramenta de análise de código que revisa pull requests no ArcticDB","ru":"ИИ Агент review-pr - это инструмент для анализа кода, который проверяет запросы на включение в ArcticDB","ar":"review-pr هو أداة لمراجعة الكود التي تستعرض طلبات الدمج في البيانات العلمية"},"features":{"en":["Resolves PR number and repository using injected context variables","Supports invocation from GitHub Actions workflow or as a local slash command","Detects PR number from the current branch if $ARGUMENTS is empty","Utilizes bash commands for automation","Integrates with ArcticDB, a high-performance, serverless DataFrame database"],"zh":["支持 GitHub Actions 工作流","自动检测 PR 号和仓库","优化 ArcticDB 服务器性能","提高数据科学工作流的效率","支持 Pandas DataFrame 数据结构"],"ja":["GitHub Actions ワークフローをサポート","PR 番号とリポジトリを自動で検出","ArcticDB サーバーレスのパフォーマンスを最適化","データサイエンスワークフローの効率を向上","Pandas DataFrame データ構造をサポート"],"ko":["GitHub Actions 워크플로를 지원","PR 번호와 저장소를 자동으로 감지","ArcticDB 서버리스 성능을 최적화","데이터 과학 작업 흐름의 효율성을 높임","Pandas DataFrame 데이터 구조를 지원"],"es":["Revisión automática de código con GitHub Actions","Integración con ArcticDB, una base de datos de DataFrame de alto rendimiento","Compatibilidad con Python y la ciencia de datos","Uso de variables de contexto como PR_NUMBER y REPO","Detección automática del número de solicitud de extracción y del repositorio"],"fr":["Révision automatique de code avec GitHub Actions","Intégration avec ArcticDB, une base de données de DataFrame haute performance","Compatibilité avec Python et la science des données","Utilisation de variables de contexte comme PR_NUMBER et REPO","Détection automatique du numéro de demande d''extraction et du référentiel"],"de":["Automatisierte Code-Überprüfung mit GitHub Actions","Integration mit ArcticDB, einer hochleistungsfähigen DataFrame-Datenbank","Kompatibilität mit Python und Data Science","Verwendung von Kontextvariablen wie PR_NUMBER und REPO","Automatische Erkennung der Pull-Request-Nummer und des Repositorys"],"pt":["Análise de código de pull requests no ArcticDB","Integração com GitHub Actions","Suporte a variáveis de contexto como PR_NUMBER e REPO","Detecção automática do número do pull request","Suporte a comandos locais como /review-pr"],"ru":["Анализ кода запросов на включение в ArcticDB","Интеграция с GitHub Actions","Поддержка контекстных переменных như PR_NUMBER и REPO","Автоматическое обнаружение номера запроса на включение","Поддержка локальных команд như /review-pr"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود لطلبات الدمج في البيانات العلمية","التكامل مع GitHub Actions","دعم متغيرات السياق مثل PR_NUMBER و REPO","الكشف التلقائي عن رقم طلب الدمج","دعم أوامر محلية مثل /review-pr"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use review-pr","review-pr setup guide","ArcticDB code review automation","review-pr alternative","review-pr vs GitHub code review","what is review-pr","review-pr install","automating code reviews for data science"],"zh":["review-pr","ArcticDB","服务器性能优化","数据科学工作流","Pandas DataFrame","GitHub Actions","代码审查工具"],"ja":["review-pr","ArcticDB","サーバーレスパフォーマンス最適化","データサイエンスワークフロー","Pandas DataFrame","GitHub Actions","コードレビューツール"],"ko":["review-pr","ArcticDB","서버리스 성능 최적화","데이터 과학 작업 흐름","Pandas DataFrame","GitHub Actions","코드 리뷰 도구"],"es":["review-pr","ArcticDB","GitHub Actions","revisión de código","DataFrame","Python","ciencia de datos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["review-pr","ArcticDB","GitHub Actions","révision de code","DataFrame","Python","science des données","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["review-pr","ArcticDB","GitHub Actions","Code-Überprüfung","DataFrame","Python","Data Science","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["review-pr","análise de código","ArcticDB","pull requests","GitHub Actions","variáveis de contexto","detecção automática","comandos locais"],"ru":["ИИ Агент review-pr","анализ кода","ArcticDB","запросы на включение","GitHub Actions","контекстные переменные","автоматическое обнаружение","локальные команды"],"ar":["review-pr","مراجعة الكود","البيانات العلمية","طلبات الدمج","GitHub Actions","متغيرات السياق","الكشف التلقائي","أوامر محلية"]}},"owner":"man-group","repo":"ArcticDB","repoPath":"man-group/ArcticDB","stars":2190,"forks":165,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T19:50:37Z","topics":["big-data","data","data-analysis","data-science","database","dataframe","pandas","quantitative-analysis","quantitative-finance","quantitative-trading"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-pr","description":"Review a pull request for ArcticDB","bodyPreview":"Perform a thorough code review of an ArcticDB pull request.\n\n## Context variables\n\nWhen invoked from a GitHub Actions workflow the following variables are injected before\nthis prompt: `PR_NUMBER`, `REPO`, `EVENT_ACTION`, `BEFORE_SHA`, `AFTER_SHA`.\nWhen invoked locally as a slash command the PR number is `$ARGUMENTS`\n(e.g. `/review-pr 2933`). If `$ARGUMENTS` is empty, detect from the current branch.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1 — Resolve PR number and repository\n\n```bash\n# If PR_NUMBER is not set and $ARGUMEN","body":"Perform a thorough code review of an ArcticDB pull request.\n\n## Context variables\n\nWhen invoked from a GitHub Actions workflow the following variables are injected before\nthis prompt: `PR_NUMBER`, `REPO`, `EVENT_ACTION`, `BEFORE_SHA`, `AFTER_SHA`.\nWhen invoked locally as a slash command the PR number is `$ARGUMENTS`\n(e.g. `/review-pr 2933`). If `$ARGUMENTS` is empty, detect from the current branch.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1 — Resolve PR number and repository\n\n```bash\n# If PR_NUMBER is not set and $ARGUMENTS is empty, detect from current branch:\ngh pr view --json number -q .number\n\n# If REPO is not set, detect:\ngh repo view --json nameWithOwner -q .nameWithOwner\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 2 — Fetch diffs\n\n**If `EVENT_ACTION` is `synchronize` and both `BEFORE_SHA` and `AFTER_SHA` are set:**\n\nAttempt to produce the delta diff (new commits only):\n\n```bash\ngit fetch --depth=1 origin <BEFORE_SHA>\ngit diff <BEFORE_SHA>..<AFTER_SHA>\n```\n\n- If the delta diff is non-empty, use it as the **delta diff**. Do not fetch the full\n  diff — it is not needed (the existing sticky summary covers the earlier commits).\n- If the fetch fails (e.g. force-push removed `BEFORE_SHA`) or the result is empty,\n  fall back: fetch the full diff and use it for both inline comments and summary.\n\n```bash\ngh pr diff <PR_NUMBER>   # fallback only\n```\n\n**Otherwise** (event is `opened`, `reopened`, `ready_for_review`, or this is a local run):\n\nFetch the full diff and use it as both the full diff and the delta diff:\n\n```bash\ngh pr diff <PR_NUMBER>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 3 — Fetch existing inline review comments and sticky summary\n\nFetch all existing inline review comments (for deduplication):\n\n```bash\ngh api --paginate \"repos/<REPO>/pulls/<PR_NUMBER>/comments\" \\\n  --jq ''[.[] | {path: .path, line: (.line // .original_line), author: .user.login, body: (.body | .[0:300])}]''\n```\n\nAlso fetch the existing sticky summary comment, if any (for incremental updates):\n\n```bash\ngh api \"repos/<REPO>/issues/<PR_NUMBER>/comments\" \\\n  --jq ''[.[] | select(.body | startswith(\"## ArcticDB Code Review Summary\"))] | last | {id: .id, body: .body}''\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 4 — Deduplication rule\n\nBefore posting any inline comment, check the existing comments for an entry with the\nsame `path` and `line`:\n\n- **Human comment exists**: skip the inline comment. Note the finding in the summary\n  checklist if relevant.\n- **Previous Claude comment exists**: skip the inline comment. Ensure the finding is\n  still reflected in the summary checklist.\n- **No existing comment**: post the inline comment normally.\n\n---\n\n## Step 5 — Review outputs\n\n### Inline comments\nPost only on lines present in the **delta diff**, subject to the deduplication rule above.\n\n### Summary checklist\n\n**If `EVENT_ACTION` is `synchronize` and a previous sticky summary exists:**\n\n- Evaluate only the **delta diff** against the guidelines.\n- Read the previous summary checklist.\n- Update individual checklist items that are affected by the delta:\n  - A new commit that **introduces** an issue: change the item to ❌ and add a note.\n  - A new commit that **fixes** a previously flagged issue: change the item to ✅ and\n    note the fix.\n  - Items unaffected by the delta: leave unchanged.\n- Post the amended summary as the updated sticky comment.\n\n**Otherwise** (event is `opened`, `reopened`, `ready_for_review`, or no previous summary):\n\nEvaluate the **full diff** and post a fresh summary checklist.\n\n---\n\n## Step 6 — Load review guidelines\n\nRead the file `docs/claude/PR_REVIEW_GUIDELINES.md` from the repository root using the\nRead tool. Apply all sections relevant to the files changed in the PR. The file also\ncontains the summary checklist format to use when posting the sticky comment.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:25:15.552Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing automated analysis of ArcticDB pull requests in the Python Data Science ecosystem.","zh":"非常适合需要自动分析ArcticDB拉取请求的代码审查代理，在Python数据科学生态系统中。","ja":"ArcticDBのプルリクエストの自動分析が必要なコードレビューエージェントに最適です。Pythonデータサイエンスエコシステムで。","ko":"ArcticDB 풀 リクエスト의 자동 분석이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다. Python 데이터 과학 에코システム에서","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan análisis automatizado de solicitudes de extracción de ArcticDB en el ecosistema de ciencia de datos de Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une analyse automatisée des demandes d''extraction d''ArcticDB dans l''écosystème de science des données Python.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine automatisierte Analyse von ArcticDB-Pull-Requests im Python-Data-Science-Ökosystem benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de análise automatizada de solicitações de pull do ArcticDB no ecossistema de Ciência de Dados do Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодового обзора, которым требуется автоматизированный анализ запросов на включение изменений в ArcticDB в экосистеме Data Science на Python.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل تلقائي لطلبات السحب من ArcticDB في نظام بيثون للعلوم البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough code reviews of ArcticDB pull requests using GitHub Actions workflow variables like PR_NUMBER, REPO, and EVENT_ACTION, ensuring high-quality code submissions.","zh":"赋予代理在GitHub Actions工作流变量（如PR_NUMBER、REPO和EVENT_ACTION）中执行ArcticDB拉取请求的彻底代码审查，确保高质量的代码提交。","ja":"PR_NUMBER、REPO、EVENT_ACTIONなどのGitHub Actionsワークフロー変数を使用して、ArcticDBのプルリクエストの徹底的なコードレビューを実行できるようにエージェントをエンパワーメントし、高品質のコード提出を保証します。","ko":"PR_NUMBER, REPO 및 EVENT_ACTION와 같은 GitHub Actions 워크플로 변수를 사용하여 ArcticDB 풀 리クエ스트의 철저한 코드 리뷰를 수행할 수 있도록 에이전트를 활성화하여 높은 품질의 코드 제출을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar revisiones de código exhaustivas de solicitudes de extracción de ArcticDB utilizando variables de flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions como PR_NUMBER, REPO y EVENT_ACTION, lo que garantiza la presentación de código de alta calidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des révisions de code approfondies des demandes d''extraction d''ArcticDB en utilisant des variables de workflow GitHub Actions comme PR_NUMBER, REPO et EVENT_ACTION, garantissant ainsi des soumissions de code de haute qualité.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, gründliche Code-Reviews von ArcticDB-Pull-Requests durchzuführen, die GitHub Actions-Workflow-Variablen wie PR_NUMBER, REPO und EVENT_ACTION verwenden, um hochwertige Code-Eingaben sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar revisões de código abrangentes das solicitações de pull do ArcticDB usando variáveis de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub Actions como PR_NUMBER, REPO e EVENT_ACTION, garantindo a submissão de código de alta qualidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять тщательные обзоры кода запросов на включение изменений в ArcticDB с использованием переменных рабочего процесса GitHub Actions, таких как PR_NUMBER, REPO и EVENT_ACTION, гарантируя подачу кода высокого качества.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إجراء مراجعة شاملة للكود لطلبات السحب من ArcticDB باستخدام متغيرات سير عمل GitHub Actions مثل PR_NUMBER و REPO و EVENT_ACTION ، مما يضمن تقديم رمز ذي جودة عالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for ArcticDB pull requests","Analyzing code changes between BEFORE_SHA and AFTER_SHA commits","Detecting PR numbers from current branch or $ARGUMENTS"],"zh":["自动化ArcticDB拉取请求的代码审查","分析BEFORE_SHA和AFTER_SHA提交之间的代码更改","从当前分支或$ARGUMENTS中检测PR编号"],"ja":["ArcticDBのプルリクエストのコードレビューの自動化","BEFORE_SHAとAFTER_SHAのコミット間のコード変更の分析","現在のブランチまたは$ARGUMENTSからPR番号の検出"],"ko":["ArcticDB 풀 리クエ스트의 코드 리뷰 자동화","BEFORE_SHA와 AFTER_SHA 커밋 간의 코드 변경 분석","현재 브랜치 또는 $ARGUMENTS에서 PR 번호 감지"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de código para solicitudes de extracción de ArcticDB","Análisis de cambios de código entre los commits BEFORE_SHA y AFTER_SHA","Detección de números de PR desde la rama actual o $ARGUMENTS"],"fr":["Automatisation des révisions de code pour les demandes d''extraction d''ArcticDB","Analyse des modifications de code entre les validations BEFORE_SHA et AFTER_SHA","Détection des numéros de PR à partir de la branche actuelle ou $ARGUMENTS"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Reviews für ArcticDB-Pull-Requests","Analyse von Code-Änderungen zwischen den Commits BEFORE_SHA und AFTER_SHA","Erkennung von PR-Nummern aus dem aktuellen Zweig oder $ARGUMENTS"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para solicitações de pull do ArcticDB","Analizar alterações de código entre os commits BEFORE_SHA e AFTER_SHA","Detectar números de PR do branch atual ou $ARGUMENTS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обзор кода для запросов на включение изменений в ArcticDB","Анализировать изменения кода между коммитами BEFORE_SHA и AFTER_SHA","Обнаруживать номера PR из текущей ветки или $ARGUMENTS"],"ar":["توفير自动ية لمراجعة الكود لطلبات السحب من ArcticDB","تحليل التغييرات في الكود بين قبل SHA و بعد SHA","اكتشاف أرقام PR من الفرع الحالي أو $ARGUMENTS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Actions workflow setup","Limited to ArcticDB and Python Data Science ecosystem","Needs $ARGUMENTS or PR_NUMBER to be set"],"zh":["需要GitHub Actions工作流设置","仅限ArcticDB和Python数据科学生态系统","需要$ARGUMENTS或PR_NUMBER设置"],"ja":["GitHub Actionsワークフローの設定が必要","ArcticDBとPythonデータサイエンスエコシステムのみ","$ARGUMENTSまたはPR_NUMBERの設定が必要"],"ko":["GitHub Actions 워크플로 설정이 필요합니다","ArcticDB 및 Python 데이터 과학 에코システム만 해당","$ARGUMENTS 또는 PR_NUMBER 설정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions","Limitado a ArcticDB y el ecosistema de ciencia de datos de Python","Necesita que $ARGUMENTS o PR_NUMBER estén establecidos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de workflow GitHub Actions","Limité à ArcticDB et à l''écosystème de science des données Python","Nécessite que $ARGUMENTS ou PR_NUMBER soient définis"],"de":["Benötigt eine GitHub Actions-Workflow-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf ArcticDB und das Python-Data-Science-Ökosystem","Benötigt, dass $ARGUMENTS oder PR_NUMBER festgelegt sind"],"pt":["Requer configuração do fluxo de trabalho do GitHub Actions","Limitado ao ArcticDB e ao ecossistema de Ciência de Dados do Python","Necessita que $ARGUMENTS ou PR_NUMBER sejam definidos"],"ru":["Требуется настройка рабочего процесса GitHub Actions","Ограничен до ArcticDB и экосистемы Data Science на Python","Требуется установка $ARGUMENTS или PR_NUMBER"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد سير عمل GitHub Actions","محدود إلى ArcticDB ونظام بيثون للعلوم البيانات","يحتاج إلى ضبط $ARGUMENTS أو PR_NUMBER"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a5d9a1035857d0faf783feb6df56f5647e41af49b3fe170be0a3b1daf0e517b6","qualityScore":55}');
