ollo","package.json","pyproject.toml","mejores prácticas para alfred","Read","Bash","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["détection de langages de programmation","moai-alfred-language-detection","outils de développement","package.json","pyproject.toml","meilleures pratiques pour alfred","Read","Bash","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Spracherkennung","moai-alfred-language-detection","Entwicklungstools","package.json","pyproject.toml","Best Practices für Alfred","Read","Bash","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["detecção de linguagem","moai-alfred-language-detection","package.json","pyproject.toml","Alfred","Bash","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["определение языка","moai-alfred-language-detection","package.json","pyproject.toml","Alfred","Bash","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["كشف اللغة","moai-alfred-language-detection","package.json","pyproject.toml","Alfred","Bash","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"kivo360","repo":"quickhooks","repoPath":"kivo360/quickhooks","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.364Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"moai-alfred-language-detection","description":"Auto-detects project language and framework from package.json, pyproject.toml, etc.","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Alfred Language Detection Skill\n\n## Skill Metadata\n\n| Field | Value |\n| ----- | ----- |\n| **Skill Name** | moai-alfred-language-detection |\n| **Version** | 2.0.0 (2025-10-22) |\n| **Allowed tools** | Read (read_file), Bash (terminal) |\n| **Auto-load** | On demand when keywords detected |\n| **Tier** | Alfred |\n\n---\n\n## What It Does\n\nAuto-detects project language and framework from package.json, pyproject.toml, etc.\n\n**Key capabilities**:\n- ✅ Best practices enforcement for alfred domain\n- ✅ TRUST","body":"# Alfred Language Detection Skill\n\n## Skill Metadata\n\n| Field | Value |\n| ----- | ----- |\n| **Skill Name** | moai-alfred-language-detection |\n| **Version** | 2.0.0 (2025-10-22) |\n| **Allowed tools** | Read (read_file), Bash (terminal) |\n| **Auto-load** | On demand when keywords detected |\n| **Tier** | Alfred |\n\n---\n\n## What It Does\n\nAuto-detects project language and framework from package.json, pyproject.toml, etc.\n\n**Key capabilities**:\n- ✅ Best practices enforcement for alfred domain\n- ✅ TRUST 5 principles integration\n- ✅ Latest tool versions (2025-10-22)\n- ✅ TDD workflow support\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Automatic triggers**:\n- Related code discussions and file patterns\n- SPEC implementation (`/alfred:2-run`)\n- Code review requests\n\n**Manual invocation**:\n- Review code for TRUST 5 compliance\n- Design new features\n- Troubleshoot issues\n\n---\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Language-specific source directories\n- Configuration files\n- Test suites and sample data\n\n## Outputs\n\n- Test/lint execution plan\n- TRUST 5 review checkpoints\n- Migration guidance\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- When required tools are not installed\n- When dependencies are missing\n- When test coverage falls below 85%\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- Access to project files via Read/Bash tools\n- Integration with `moai-foundation-langs` for language detection\n- Integration with `moai-foundation-trust` for quality gates\n\n---\n\n## References (Latest Documentation)\n\n_Documentation links updated 2025-10-22_\n\n---\n\n## Changelog\n\n- **v2.0.0** (2025-10-22): Major update with latest tool versions, comprehensive best practices, TRUST 5 integration\n- **v1.0.0** (2025-03-29): Initial Skill release\n\n---\n\n## Works Well With\n\n- `moai-foundation-trust` (quality gates)\n- `moai-alfred-code-reviewer` (code review)\n- `moai-essentials-debug` (debugging support)\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n✅ **DO**:\n- Follow alfred best practices\n- Use latest stable tool versions\n- Maintain test coverage ≥85%\n- Document all public APIs\n\n❌ **DON''T**:\n- Skip quality gates\n- Use deprecated tools\n- Ignore security warnings\n- Mix testing frameworks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:20.773Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Analysis Agents requiring automated language and framework detection in project repositories.","zh":"适用于需要在项目仓库中自动检测语言和框架的代码分析代理。","ja":"プロジェクトリポジトリで自動的に言語とフレームワークを検出する必要があるコード分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"프로젝트 저장소에서 자동으로 언어와 프레임워크를 감지해야 하는 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Código que requieren detección automatizada de lenguaje y framework en repositorios de proyectos.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code nécessitant une détection automatique de langage et de framework dans les référentiels de projets.","de":"Ideal für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine automatisierte Sprach- und Framework-Erkennung in Projekt-Repositorys benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Código que exigem detecção automática de linguagem e estrutura em repositórios de projetos.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Кодов, требующих автоматического обнаружения языка и фреймворка в репозиториях проектов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الشفرة التي تتطلب الكشف التلقائي عن اللغة والإطار في مستودعات المشروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to auto-detect project languages and frameworks from files like package.json and pyproject.toml, enforcing best practices for the Alfred domain and ensuring TRUST compliance through terminal and file read capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理自动检测项目语言和框架的能力，通过文件如 package.json 和 pyproject.toml 强制执行 Alfred 域的最佳实践，并通过终端和文件读取功能确保 TRUST 合规性。","ja":"エージェントにプロジェクト言語とフレームワークを自動的に検出する能力を付与し、package.json や pyproject.toml などのファイルを介して Alfred ドメインのベストプラクティスを強制し、ターミナルおよびファイル読み取り機能を通じて TRUST コンプライアンスを確保する。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 언어와 프레임워크를 자동으로 감지할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 package.json 및 pyproject.toml과 같은 파일을 통해 Alfred 도메인의 모범 사례를 시행하고 터미널 및 파일 읽기 기능을 통해 TRUST 규정 준수를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a detectar automáticamente los lenguajes y frameworks de proyectos a partir de archivos como package.json y pyproject.toml, aplicando las mejores p