's Agents SDK"],"ja":["Connects to WhatsApp","Has memory","Scheduled jobs","Runs directly on Anthropic''s Agents SDK"],"ko":["Connects to WhatsApp","Has memory","Scheduled jobs","Runs directly on Anthropic''s Agents SDK"],"es":["Conexión con WhatsApp","Memoria y trabajos programados","Alternativa ligera a Clawdbot","Compatibilidad con Anthropic''s Agents SDK","Seguridad mediante contenedores"],"fr":["Connexion à WhatsApp","Mémoire et tâches planifiées","Alternative légère à Clawdbot","Compatibilité avec Anthropic''s Agents SDK","Sécurité via des conteneurs"],"de":["Verbindung mit WhatsApp","Speicher und geplante Aufgaben","Leichtgewichtige Alternative zu Clawdbot","Kompatibilität mit Anthropic''s Agents SDK","Sicherheit durch Container"],"pt":["Conectividade com o WhatsApp","Memória e tarefas agendadas","Execução direta no Agents SDK da Anthropic","Segurança em contêineres","Alternativa leve ao Clawdbot/OpenClaw"],"ru":["Подключение к WhatsApp","Память и запланированные задачи","Прямое выполнение в Agents SDK от Anthropic","Безопасность в контейнерах","Легковесная альтернатива Clawdbot/OpenClaw"],"ar":["التواصل مع WhatsApp","الذاكرة والمهام المجدولة","التشغيل المباشر على واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Agents SDK من Anthropic","الأمان في الحاويات","بديل خفيف لبرنامج Clawdbot/OpenClaw"]},"keywords":{"zh":["how to use debug","what is debug","debug alternative","debug vs clawdbot","debug install","debug setup guide"],"ja":["how to use debug","what is debug","debug alternative","debug vs clawdbot","debug install","debug setup guide"],"ko":["how to use debug","what is debug","debug alternative","debug vs clawdbot","debug install","debug setup guide"],"es":["cómo usar agente de depuración","qué es un agente de AI","agente de depuración vs Clawdbot","instalar agente de depuración","guía de configuración de agente de depuración","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","agentes de AI para WhatsApp","depuración de código con agente de AI"],"fr":["comment utiliser l''agent de débogage","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''AI","agent de débogage vs Clawdbot","installer l''agent de débogage","guide de configuration de l''agent de débogage","outils d''AI pour développeurs","agents d''AI pour WhatsApp","débogage de code avec agent d''AI"],"de":["wie man den Debug-Agenten verwendet","was ist ein AI-Agent","Debug-Agent vs Clawdbot","Debug-Agent installieren","Einrichtungsanleitung für den Debug-Agenten","AI-Tools für Entwickler","AI-Agents für WhatsApp","Code-Debugging mit AI-Agent"],"pt":["o que é agente de ia","como usar depurar","alternativa ao clawdbot","depurar vs openclaw","instalar depurar","guia de configuração do depurar","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","agente de ia para whatsapp"],"ru":["что такое ии агенты","как использовать отладку","альтернатива clawdbot","отладка vs openclaw","установить отладку","руководство по настройке отладки","инструменты ии для разработчиков","ии агенты для whatsapp"],"ar":["ما هي تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام تصحيح أخطاء","بديل لبرنامج clawdbot","تصحيح أخطاء مقابل openclaw","تثبيت تصحيح أخطاء","دليل إعداد تصحيح أخطاء","أدوات تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي لبرنامج whatsapp"]}},"owner":"qwibitai","repo":"nanoclaw","repoPath":"qwibitai/nanoclaw","stars":14853,"forks":2286,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T04:54:01Z","topics":["ai-agents","ai-assistant","claude-code","claude-skills","clawdbot"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"debug","description":"Debug container agent issues. Use when things arent working, container fails, authentication problems, or to understand how the container system works. Covers logs, environment variables, mounts, and common issues.","bodyPreview":"# NanoClaw Container Debugging\n\nThis guide covers debugging the containerized agent execution system.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\nHost (macOS)                          Container (Linux VM)\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nsrc/container-runner.ts               container/agent-runner/\n    │                                      │\n    │ spawns container                      │ runs Claude Agent SDK\n    │ with volume mounts                   │ with MCP servers\n    │","body":"# NanoClaw Container Debugging\n\nThis guide covers debugging the containerized agent execution system.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\nHost (macOS)                          Container (Linux VM)\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nsrc/container-runner.ts               container/agent-runner/\n    │                                      │\n    │ spawns container                      │ runs Claude Agent SDK\n    │ with volume mounts                   │ with MCP servers\n    │                                      │\n    ├── data/env/env ──────────────> /workspace/env-dir/env\n    ├── groups/{folder} ───────────> /workspace/group\n    ├── data/ipc/{folder} ────────> /workspace/ipc\n    ├── data/sessions/{folder}/.claude/ ──> /home/node/.claude/ (isolated per-group)\n    └── (main only) project root ──> /workspace/project\n```\n\n**Important:** The container runs as user `node` with `HOME=/home/node`. Session files must be mounted to `/home/node/.claude/` (not `/root/.claude/`) for session resumption to work.\n\n## Log Locations\n\n| Log | Location | Content |\n|-----|----------|---------|\n| **Main app logs** | `logs/nanoclaw.log` | Host-side WhatsApp, routing, container spawning |\n| **Main app errors** | `logs/nanoclaw.error.log` | Host-side errors |\n| **Container run logs** | `groups/{folder}/logs/container-*.log` | Per-run: input, mounts, stderr, stdout |\n| **Claude sessions** | `~/.claude/projects/` | Claude Code session history |\n\n## Enabling Debug Logging\n\nSet `LOG_LEVEL=debug` for verbose output:\n\n```bash\n# For development\nLOG_LEVEL=debug npm run dev\n\n# For launchd service (macOS), add to plist EnvironmentVariables:\n<key>LOG_LEVEL</key>\n<string>debug</string>\n# For systemd service (Linux), add to unit [Service] section:\n# Environment=LOG_LEVEL=debug\n```\n\nDebug level shows:\n- Full mount configurations\n- Container command arguments\n- Real-time container stderr\n\n## Common Issues\n\n### 1. \"Claude Code process exited with code 1\"\n\n**Check the container log file** in `groups/{folder}/logs/container-*.log`\n\nCommon causes:\n\n#### Missing Authentication\n```\nInvalid API key · Please run /login\n```\n**Fix:** Ensure `.env` file exists with either OAuth token or API key:\n```bash\ncat .env  # Should show one of:\n# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=sk-ant-oat01-...  (subscription)\n# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...        (pay-per-use)\n```\n\n#### Root User Restriction\n```\n--dangerously-skip-permissions cannot be used with root/sudo privileges\n```\n**Fix:** Container must run as non-root user. Check Dockerfile has `USER node`.\n\n### 2. Environment Variables Not Passing\n\n**Runtime note:** Environment variables passed via `-e` may be lost when using `-i` (interactive/piped stdin).\n\n**Workaround:** The system extracts only authentication variables (`CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN`, `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`) from `.env` and mounts them for sourcing inside the container. Other env vars are not exposed.\n\nTo verify env vars are reaching the container:\n```bash\necho ''{}'' | docker run -i \\\n  -v $(pwd)/data/env:/workspace/env-dir:ro \\\n  --entrypoint /bin/bash nanoclaw-agent:latest \\\n  -c ''export $(cat /workspace/env-dir/env | xargs); echo \"OAuth: ${#CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN} chars, API: ${#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY} chars\"''\n```\n\n### 3. Mount Issues\n\n**Container mount notes:**\n- Docker supports both `-v` and `--mount` syntax\n- Use `:ro` suffix for readonly mounts:\n  ```bash\n  # Readonly\n  -v /path:/container/path:ro\n\n  # Read-write\n  -v /path:/container/path\n  ```\n\nTo check what''s mounted inside a container:\n```bash\ndocker run --rm --entrypoint /bin/bash nanoclaw-agent:latest -c ''ls -la /workspace/''\n```\n\nExpected structure:\n```\n/workspace/\n├── env-dir/env           # Environment file (CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)\n├── group/                # Current group folder (cwd)\n├── project/              # Project root (main channel only)\n├── global/               # Global CLAUDE.md (non-main only)\n├── ipc/                  # Inter-process communication\n│   ├── messages/         # Outgoing WhatsApp messages\n│   ├── tasks/            # Scheduled task commands\n│   ├── current_tasks.json    # Read-only: scheduled tasks visible to this group\n│   └── available_groups.json # Read-only: WhatsApp groups for activation (main only)\n└── extra/                # Additional custom mounts\n```\n\n### 4. Permission Issues\n\nThe container runs as user `node` (uid 1000). Check ownership:\n```bash\ndocker run --rm --entrypoint /bin/bash nanoclaw-agent:latest -c ''\n  whoami\n  ls -la /workspace/\n  ls -la /app/\n''\n```\n\nAll of `/workspace/` and `/app/` should be owned by `node`.\n\n### 5. Session Not Resuming / \"Claude Code process exited with code 1\"\n\nIf sessions aren''t being resumed (new session ID every time), or Claude Code exits with code 1 when resuming:\n\n**Root cause:** The SDK looks for sessions at `$HOME/.claude/projects/`. Inside the container, `HOME=/home/node`, so it looks at `/home/node/.claude/projects/`.\n\n**Check the mount path:**\n```bash\n# In container-runner.ts, verify mount is to /home/node/.claude/, NOT /root/.claude/\ngrep -A3 \"Claude sessions\" src/container-runner.ts\n```\n\n**Verify sessions are accessible:**\n```bash\ndocker run --rm --entrypoint /bin/bash \\\n  -v ~/.claude:/home/node/.claude \\\n  nanoclaw-agent:latest -c ''\necho \"HOME=$HOME\"\nls -la $HOME/.claude/projects/ 2>&1 | head -5\n''\n```\n\n**Fix:** Ensure `container-runner.ts` mounts to `/home/node/.claude/`:\n```typescript\nmounts.push({\n  hostPath: claudeDir,\n  containerPath: ''/home/node/.claude'',  // NOT /root/.claude\n  readonly: false\n});\n```\n\n### 6. MCP Server Failures\n\nIf an MCP server fails to start, the agent may exit. Check the container logs for MCP initialization errors.\n\n## Manual Container Testing\n\n### Test the full agent flow:\n```bash\n# Set up env file\nmkdir -p data/env groups/test\ncp .env data/env/env\n\n# Run test query\necho ''{\"prompt\":\"What is 2+2?\",\"groupFolder\":\"test\",\"chatJid\":\"test@g.us\",\"isMain\":false}'' | \\\n  docker run -i \\\n  -v $(pwd)/data/env:/workspace/env-dir:ro \\\n  -v $(pwd)/groups/test:/workspace/group \\\n  -v $(pwd)/data/ipc:/workspace/ipc \\\n  nanoclaw-agent:latest\n```\n\n### Test Claude Code directly:\n```bash\ndocker run --rm --entrypoint /bin/bash \\\n  -v $(pwd)/data/env:/workspace/env-dir:ro \\\n  nanoclaw-agent:latest -c ''\n  export $(cat /workspace/env-dir/env | xargs)\n  claude -p \"Say hello\" --dangerously-skip-permissions --allowedTools \"\"\n''\n```\n\n### Interactive shell in container:\n```bash\ndocker run --rm -it --entrypoint /bin/bash nanoclaw-agent:latest\n```\n\n## SDK Options Reference\n\nThe agent-runner uses these Claude Agent SDK options:\n\n```typescript\nquery({\n  prompt: input.prompt,\n  options: {\n    cwd: ''/workspace/group'',\n    allowedTools: [''Bash'', ''Read'', ''Write'', ...],\n    permissionMode: ''bypassPermissions'',\n    allowDangerouslySkipPermissions: true,  // Required with bypassPermissions\n    settingSources: [''project''],\n    mcpServers: { ... }\n  }\n})\n```\n\n**Important:** `allowDangerouslySkipPermissions: true` is required when using `permissionMode: ''bypassPermissions''`. Without it, Claude Code exits with code 1.\n\n## Rebuilding After Changes\n\n```bash\n# Rebuild main app\nnpm run build\n\n# Rebuild container (use --no-cache for clean rebuild)\n./container/build.sh\n\n# Or force full rebuild\ndocker builder prune -af\n./container/build.sh\n```\n\n## Checking Container Image\n\n```bash\n# List images\ndocker images\n\n# Check what''s in the image\ndocker run --rm --entrypoint /bin/bash nanoclaw-agent:latest -c ''\n  echo \"=== Node version ===\"\n  node --version\n\n  echo \"=== Claude Code version ===\"\n  claude --version\n\n  echo \"=== Installed packages ===\"\n  ls /app/node_modules/\n''\n```\n\n## Session Persistence\n\nClaude sessions are stored per-group in `data/sessions/{group}/.claude/` for security isolation. Each group has its own session directory, preventing cross-group access to conversation history.\n\n**Critical:** The mount path must match the container user''s HOME directory:\n- Container user: `node`\n- Container HOME: `/home/node`\n- Mount target: `/home/node/.claude/` (NOT `/root/.claude/`)\n\nTo clear sessions:\n\n```bash\n# Clear all sessions for all groups\nrm -rf data/sessions/\n\n# Clear sessions for a specific group\nrm -rf data/sessions/{groupFolder}/.claude/\n\n# Also clear the session ID from NanoClaw''s tracking (stored in SQLite)\nsqlite3 store/messages.db \"DELETE FROM sessions WHERE group_folder = ''{groupFolder}''\"\n```\n\nTo verify session resumption is working, check the logs for the same session ID across messages:\n```bash\ngrep \"Session initialized\" logs/nanoclaw.log | tail -5\n# Should show the SAME session ID for consecutive messages in the same group\n```\n\n## IPC Debugging\n\nThe container communicates back to the host via files in `/workspace/ipc/`:\n\n```bash\n# Check pending messages\nls -la data/ipc/messages/\n\n# Check pending task operations\nls -la data/ipc/tasks/\n\n# Read a specific IPC file\ncat data/ipc/messages/*.json\n\n# Check available groups (main channel only)\ncat data/ipc/main/available_groups.json\n\n# Check current tasks snapshot\ncat data/ipc/{groupFolder}/current_tasks.json\n```\n\n**IPC file types:**\n- `messages/*.json` - Agent writes: outgoing WhatsApp messages\n- `tasks/*.json` - Agent writes: task operations (schedule, pause, resume, cancel, refresh_groups)\n- `current_tasks.json` - Host writes: read-only snapshot of scheduled tasks\n- `available_groups.json` - Host writes: read-only list of WhatsApp groups (main only)\n\n## Quick Diagnostic Script\n\nRun this to check common issues:\n\n```bash\necho \"=== Checking NanoClaw Container Setup ===\"\n\necho -e \"\\n1. Authentication configured?\"\n[ -f .env ] && (grep -q \"CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=sk-\" .env || grep -q \"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-\" .env) && echo \"OK\" || echo \"MISSING - add CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY to .env\"\n\necho -e \"\\n2. Env file copied for container?\"\n[ -f data/env/env ] && echo \"OK\" || echo \"MISSING - will be created on first run\"\n\necho -e \"\\n3. Container runtime running?\"\ndocker info &>/dev/null && echo \"OK\" || echo \"NOT RUNNING - start Docker Desktop (macOS) or sudo systemctl start docker (Linux)\"\n\necho -e \"\\n4. Container image exists?\"\necho ''{}'' | docker run -i --entrypoint /bin/echo nanoclaw-agent:latest \"OK\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"MISSING - run ./container/build.sh\"\n\necho -e \"\\n5. Session mount path correct?\"\ngrep -q \"/home/node/.claude\" src/container-runner.ts 2>/dev/null && echo \"OK\" || echo \"WRONG - should mount to /home/node/.claude/, not /root/.claude/\"\n\necho -e \"\\n6. Groups directory?\"\nls -la groups/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"MISSING - run setup\"\n\necho -e \"\\n7. Recent container logs?\"\nls -t groups/*/logs/container-*.log 2>/dev/null | head -3 || echo \"No container logs yet\"\n\necho -e \"\\n8. Session continuity working?\"\nSESSIONS=$(grep \"Session initialized\" logs/nanoclaw.log 2>/dev/null | tail -5 | awk ''{print $NF}'' | sort -u | wc -l)\n[ \"$SESSIONS\" -le 2 ] && echo \"OK (recent sessions reusing IDs)\" || echo \"CHECK - multiple different session IDs, may indicate resumption issues\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:26:19.181Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Containerized Agents needing lightweight, secure debugging capabilities with WhatsApp connectivity and scheduled jobs.","zh":"非常适合需要轻量、安全的调试功能以及WhatsApp连接和定时任务的容器化代理。","ja":"コンテナ化エージェントに軽量でセキュアなデバッグ機能とWhatsApp接続およびスケジュールジョブが必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"가벼우면서도 보안이 강화된 디버깅 기능과 WhatsApp 연결 및 예약 작업이 필요한 컨테이너화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes contenedorizados que necesitan capacidades de depuración ligeras y seguras con conectividad de WhatsApp y trabajos programados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents conteneurisés nécessitant des capacités de débogage légères et sécurisées avec une connectivité WhatsApp et des tâches planifiées.","de":"Perfekt für containerisierte Agenten, die leichte, sichere Debugging-Funktionen mit WhatsApp-Verbindung und geplanten Aufgaben benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Containerizados que precisam de capacidades de depuração leves e seguras com conectividade do WhatsApp e trabalhos agendados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для контейнеризированных агентов, которым требуются легкие и безопасные возможности отладки с подключением WhatsApp и запланированными задачами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحتويين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات فحص خفيفة وأمنة مع اتصال WhatsApp ووظائف مجدولة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run directly on Anthropic''s Agents SDK, utilizing containerized execution for enhanced security, while also leveraging memory and scheduled jobs for efficient debugging, all within a lightweight alternative to Clawdbot / OpenClaw.","zh":"赋予代理直接在Anthropic的Agents SDK上运行的能力，利用容器化执行来增强安全性，同时利用内存和定时任务来实现高效的调试，所有这些都在Clawdbot / OpenClaw的轻量级替代品中实现。","ja":"AnthropicのAgents SDK上で直接エージェントを実行する能力を付与し、コンテナ化された実行を利用してセキュリティを強化し、同時にメモリとスケジュールジョブを利用して効率的なデバッグを実現し、すべてClawdbot / OpenClawの軽量代替品の中で実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Anthropic의 에이전트 SDK에서 직접 실행되는 기능을 제공하여 컨테이너화된 실행을 통해 보안을 강화하고,同时 메모리와 예약 작업을 활용하여 효율적인 디버깅을 thực現하며, 모두 Clawdbot / OpenClaw의 경량 대체품에서 실現합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutarse directamente en el SDK de Agentes de Anthropic, utilizando la ejecución contenedorizada para una mayor seguridad, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha la memoria y los trabajos programados para una depuración eficiente, todo dentro de una alternativa ligera a Clawdbot / OpenClaw.","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''exécuter directement sur le SDK d''agents d''Anthropic, en utilisant l''exécution conteneurisée pour une sécurité renforcée, tout en exploitant la mémoire et les tâches planifiées pour un débogage efficace, le tout dans une alternative légère à Clawdbot / OpenClaw.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, direkt auf Anthropics Agents SDK zu laufen, wobei containerisierte Ausführung für erhöhte Sicherheit genutzt wird, während auch Speicher und geplante Aufgaben für effizientes Debugging genutzt werden, all dies in einer leichten Alternative zu Clawdbot / OpenClaw.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a serem executados diretamente no Agents SDK da Anthropic, utilizando a execução containerizada para segurança aprimorada, aproveitando também a memória e os trabalhos agendados para depuração eficiente, tudo dentro de uma alternativa leve ao Clawdbot / OpenClaw.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускаться直接 в Agents SDK от Anthropic, используя контейнеризированную выполнение для повышения безопасности, а также использует память и запланированные задачи для эффективной отладки, все это в легкой альтернативе Clawdbot / OpenClaw.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التشغيل مباشرة على Agents SDK من Anthropic، باستخدام التنفيذ المحتوي لتحسين الأمان، واستخدام الذاكرة والوظائف المجدولة لعمليات فحص فعالة، كل ذلك في بديل خفيف عن Clawdbot / OpenClaw."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging containerized agent execution systems","Troubleshooting WhatsApp connectivity issues","Scheduling jobs for automated debugging tasks"],"zh":["调试容器化代理执行系统","解决WhatsApp连接问题","为自动化调试任务安排作业"],"ja":["コンテナ化エージェント実行システムのデバッグ","WhatsApp接続の問題を解決する","自動化されたデバッグタスクのジョブをスケジュールする"],"ko":["컨테이너화된 에이전트 실행 시스템 디버깅","WhatsApp 연결 문제 해결","자동화된 디버깅 작업 예약"],"es":["Depuración de sistemas de ejecución de agentes contenedorizados","Solución de problemas de conectividad de WhatsApp","Programación de trabajos para tareas de depuración automatizadas"],"fr":["Débogage des systèmes d''exécution d''agents conteneurisés","Résolution des problèmes de connectivité WhatsApp","Planification de tâches pour des tâches de débogage automatisées"],"de":["Debugging von containerisierten Agentenausführungssystemen","Behebung von WhatsApp-Verbindungsproblemen","Planung von Aufgaben für automatisierte Debugging-Aufgaben"],"pt":["Depuração de sistemas de execução de agentes containerizados","Solução de problemas de conectividade do WhatsApp","Agendamento de trabalhos para tarefas de depuração automatizadas"],"ru":["Отладка систем выполнения контейнеризированных агентов","Устранение неполадок с подключением WhatsApp","Планирование задач для автоматизированных задач отладки"],"ar":["فحص أنظمة تشغيل الوكلاء المحتويين","حل مشاكل اتصال WhatsApp","جدولة وظائف لمهام فحص آلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires containerization support","Limited to Anthropic''s Agents SDK","Dependent on WhatsApp connectivity"],"zh":["需要容器化支持","仅限于Anthropic的Agents SDK","依赖于WhatsApp连接"],"ja":["コンテナ化のサポートが必要","AnthropicのAgents SDKに限定される","WhatsApp接続に依存する"],"ko":["컨테이너화 지원 필요","Anthropic의 에이전트 SDK에만 제한","WhatsApp 연결에 의존"],"es":["Requiere soporte de contenedorización","Limitado al SDK de Agentes de Anthropic","Dependiente de la conectividad de WhatsApp"],"fr":["Nécessite un support de conteneurisation","Limité au SDK d''agents d''Anthropic","Dépendant de la connectivité WhatsApp"],"de":["Benötigt Containerisierungsunterstützung","Begrenzt auf Anthropics Agents SDK","Abhängig von WhatsApp-Verbindung"],"pt":["Requer suporte a containerização","Limitado ao Agents SDK da Anthropic","Dependente da conectividade do WhatsApp"],"ru":["Требует поддержки контейнеризации","Ограничен Agents SDK от Anthropic","Зависит от подключения WhatsApp"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم التحتوي","محدود بسدك Agents SDK من Anthropic","يعتمد على اتصال WhatsApp"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d774a2bc45d62e2e388a7f3de72afd761b0025f6666c3cc698c496c1805fa10e","qualityScore":55}');
