e":["KI-Tools für LiveStreams","wie man Streampai verwendet","Dokumentation von Echtzeit-Streams","Streampai vs Wettbewerber","Installation von Streampai","Einrichtungsanleitung für Streampai","Entwicklung von Echtzeit-Anwendungen","Integration von KI in LiveStreams"],"pt":["como usar Streampai","o que é Streampai","Streampai vs alternativas","guia de instalação do Streampai","configuração do Streampai","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com Streampai","Streampai para desenvolvedores","recursos de Streampai","documentação do Streampai"],"ru":["как использовать Streampai","что такое Streampai","Streampai vs альтернативы","руководство по установке Streampai","настройка Streampai","разработка приложений с Streampai","Streampai для разработчиков","ресурсы Streampai","документация Streampai"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Streampai","ما هو Streampai","Streampai مقابل البدائل","دليل تثبيت Streampai","إعداد Streampai","تطوير تطبيقات مع Streampai","Streampai للمطورين","موارد Streampai","توثيق Streampai"]}},"owner":"nxy7","repo":"streampai-elixir","repoPath":"nxy7/streampai-elixir","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T13:08:04.205Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"document","description":"Generate focused documentation for components, functions, APIs, and features","bodyPreview":"# /document - Focused Documentation Generation\n\n## Triggers\n- Documentation requests for specific components, functions, or features\n- API documentation and reference material generation needs\n- Code comment and inline documentation requirements\n- User guide and technical documentation creation requests\n\n## Usage\n```\n/document [what to document - can specify inline comments, API docs, user guide, etc.]\n```\n\n## Behavioral Flow\n1. **Analyze**: Examine target component structure, interfaces, and fu","body":"# /document - Focused Documentation Generation\n\n## Triggers\n- Documentation requests for specific components, functions, or features\n- API documentation and reference material generation needs\n- Code comment and inline documentation requirements\n- User guide and technical documentation creation requests\n\n## Usage\n```\n/document [what to document - can specify inline comments, API docs, user guide, etc.]\n```\n\n## Behavioral Flow\n1. **Analyze**: Examine target component structure, interfaces, and functionality\n2. **Identify**: Determine documentation requirements and target audience context\n3. **Generate**: Create appropriate documentation content \n4. **Format**: Apply consistent structure and organizational patterns\n5. **Integrate**: Ensure compatibility with existing project documentation ecosystem\n\nKey behaviors:\n- Code structure analysis with API extraction and usage pattern identification\n- Multi-format documentation generation (inline, external, API reference, guides)\n- Consistent formatting and cross-reference integration\n- Project-specific documentation patterns for React and Phoenix\n\n## Tool Coordination\n- **Read**: Component analysis and existing documentation review\n- **Grep**: Reference extraction and pattern identification\n- **Write**: Documentation file creation with proper formatting\n- **Glob**: Multi-file documentation projects and organization\n- **Bash (psql cli)**: Database structure analysis for data model documentation\n\n## Key Patterns\n- **Inline Documentation**: Code analysis → JSDoc/docstring generation → inline comments\n- **API Documentation**: Interface extraction → reference material → usage examples\n- **User Guides**: Feature analysis → tutorial content → implementation guidance\n- **External Docs**: Component overview → detailed specifications → integration instructions\n\n## Examples\n\n### Inline Code Documentation\n```\n/document src/auth/login.js with inline JSDoc comments\n# Generates JSDoc comments with parameter and return descriptions\n# Adds comprehensive inline documentation for functions and classes\n```\n\n### API Reference Generation\n```\n/document GraphQL API endpoints in docs/api.md\n# Creates comprehensive API documentation with endpoints and schemas\n# Generates usage examples and integration guidelines\n```\n\n### User Guide Creation\n```\n/document payment module user guide for docs/\n# Creates user-focused documentation with practical examples\n# Focuses on implementation patterns and common use cases\n```\n\n### Component Documentation\n```\n/document React components with external docs in frontend/docs/\n# Generates external documentation files for component library\n# Includes props, usage examples, and integration patterns\n```\n\n### Feature Documentation\n```\n/document user management feature in docs/features/\n# Creates comprehensive feature documentation with workflows and usage\n# Includes user stories, technical implementation, and integration points\n```\n\n## Boundaries\n\n**Will:**\n- Generate focused documentation for specific components and features\n- Create multiple documentation formats based on target audience needs\n- Integrate with existing documentation ecosystems and maintain consistency\n\n**Will Not:**\n- Generate documentation without proper code analysis and context understanding\n- Override existing documentation standards or project-specific conventions\n- Create documentation that exposes sensitive implementation details"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T13:58:06.657Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing automated documentation generation for APIs, code comments, and user guides.","zh":"非常适合需要自动为API、代码注释和用户指南生成文档的开发者代理。","ja":"API、コードのコメント、ユーザーガイドの自動ドキュメント生成を必要とするデベロッパーエージェントに最適です。","ko":"API, 코드 주석, 사용자 가이드에 대한 자동 문서 생성이 필요한 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan generación automática de documentación para APIs, comentarios de código y guías de usuario.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une génération automatisée de documentation pour les API, les commentaires de code et les guides d''utilisation.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die eine automatisierte Generierung von Dokumentationen für APIs, Codekommentare und Benutzerhandbücher benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que precisam de geração automática de documentação para APIs, comentários de código e guias de usuário.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков, которым требуется автоматизированное создание документации для API, комментариев кода и руководств пользователя.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد وثائق автомاتيكي للواجهات البرمجية وشرح الكود ودلائل المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive documentation for specific components, functions, or features, including API documentation, code comments, and technical user guides, using real-time application data from StreaMPAI.","zh":"赋予代理生成有关特定组件、函数或功能的综合文档的能力，包括API文档、代码注释和技术用户指南，使用来自StreaMPAI的实时应用程序数据。","ja":"StreaMPAIからのリアルタイムアプリケーションデータを使用して、特定のコンポーネント、関数、または機能の包括的なドキュメントを生成するエージェントを可能にします。ドキュメントには、APIドキュメント、コードのコメント、技術ユーザーガイドが含まれます。","ko":"StreaMPAI에서 실시간으로 받은 애플리케이션 데이터를 사용하여 특정 컴포넌트, 함수 또는 기능에 대한 포괄적인 문서를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다. 문서에는 API 문서, 코드 주석, 기술 사용자 가이드가 포함됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentación integral para componentes, funciones o características específicas, incluyendo documentación de API, comentarios de código y guías técnicas de usuario, utilizando datos de aplicación en tiempo real de StreaMPAI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer une documentation complète pour des composants, des fonctions ou des fonctionnalités spécifiques, y compris la documentation de l''API, les commentaires de code et les guides d''utilisation techniques, en utilisant des données d''application en temps réel de StreaMPAI.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende Dokumentationen für bestimmte Komponenten, Funktionen oder Funktionen zu erstellen, einschließlich API-Dokumentation, Codekommentare und technische Benutzerhandbücher, unter Verwendung von Echtzeit-Anwendungsdaten von StreaMPAI.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem documentação abrangente para componentes, funções ou recursos específicos, incluindo documentação de API, comentários de código e guias técnicas de usuário, utilizando dados de aplicação em tempo real do StreaMPAI.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать всестороннюю документацию для конкретных компонентов, функций или возможностей, включая документацию API, комментарии кода и технические руководства пользователя, используя данные приложения в реальном времени от StreaMPAI.","ar":"يمكن للوكيل توليد وثائق شاملة للمكونات أو الدوال أو الميزات المحددة، بما في ذلك توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وشرح الكود ودلائل الفني للمستخدم، باستخدام بيانات التطبيق في الوقت الفعلي من StreaMPAI."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating API documentation for live stream applications","Creating inline code comments for improved readability","Automating user guide creation for technical documentation"],"zh":["为直播应用程序生成API文档","创建内联代码注释以提高可读性","自动创建技术文档的用户指南"],"ja":["ライブストリームアプリケーションのAPIドキュメントを生成する","可読性を向上させるためのインラインコードコメントを作成する","技術文書のユーザーガイドの自動作成"],"ko":["실시간 스트림 애플리케이션을 위한 API 문서 생성","가독성을 개선하기 위한 인라인 코드 주석 생성","기술 문서의 사용자 가이드 자동 생성"],"es":["Generación de documentación de API para aplicaciones de transmisión en vivo","Creación de comentarios de código en línea para mejorar la legibilidad","Automatización de la creación de guías de usuario para documentación técnica"],"fr":["Génération de documentation d''API pour les applications de streaming en direct","Création de commentaires de code en ligne pour améliorer la lisibilité","Automatisation de la création de guides d''utilisation pour la documentation technique"],"de":["Generierung von API-Dokumentationen für Live-Streaming-Anwendungen","Erstellung von Inline-Codekommentaren zur Verbesserung der Lesbarkeit","Automatisierung der Erstellung von Benutzerhandbüchern für technische Dokumentationen"],"pt":["Geração de documentação de API para aplicações de transmissão ao vivo","Criação de comentários de código em linha para melhor legibilidade","Automação da criação de guias de usuário para documentação técnica"],"ru":["Генерация документации API для приложений прямой трансляции","Создание комментариев кода в строке для улучшения читаемости","Автоматизация создания руководств пользователя для технической документации"],"ar":["توليد وثائق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للتطبيقات البث المباشر","إنشاء شرح الكود داخل الخط لتحسين القراءة","أتمتة إنشاء دليل المستخدم للوثائق الفنية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific component or function to document","Limited to generating documentation for StreaMPAI live stream applications"],"zh":["需要特定的组件或函数来生成文档","仅限为StreaMPAI直播应用程序生成文档"],"ja":["ドキュメントを生成するための特定のコンポーネントまたは関数が必要","StreaMPAIのライブストリームアプリケーションのドキュメント生成のみ"],"ko":["문서를 생성하려면 특정 컴포넌트 또는 함수가 필요합니다.","StreaMPAI 실시간 스트림 애플리케이션의 문서 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere un componente o función específica para documentar","Limitado a la generación de documentación para aplicaciones de transmisión en vivo de StreaMPAI"],"fr":["Nécessite un composant ou une fonction spécifique pour documenter","Limité à la génération de documentation pour les applications de streaming en direct de StreaMPAI"],"de":["Benötigt ein bestimmtes Komponente oder Funktion zum Dokumentieren","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Dokumentationen für StreaMPAI-Live-Streaming-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer um componente ou função específico para documentar","Limitado à geração de documentação para aplicações de transmissão ao vivo do StreaMPAI"],"ru":["Требует конкретного компонента или функции для документации","Ограничен генерацией документации для приложений прямой трансляции StreaMPAI"],"ar":["يتطلب مكونًا أو دوالًا محددة لتوليد الوثائق","محدود بتوليد الوثائق للتطبيقات البث المباشر من StreaMPAI"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"325a76f8ffc046cc6f0fae06380db01fb6182f85df73416f8d7142c9ce8e1276","qualityScore":55}');
