ext.js를 사용한 빠른 개발","Sanity CMS를 통한 효율적인 콘텐츠 관리","Tailwind CSS를 통한 빠른 스타일 디자인","AWS Amplify를 통한 안전하고 신뢰할 수 있는 배포","프로그램적 SEO 최적화 지원"],"es":["Integración con Next.js y Sanity CMS","Diseño personalizable con Tailwind CSS","Implementación con AWS Amplify","Tokens de personalización y script de inicialización","Agnóstico y reutilizable"],"fr":["Intégration avec Next.js et Sanity CMS","Conception personnalisable avec Tailwind CSS","Mise en œuvre avec AWS Amplify","Jetons de personnalisation et script d''initialisation","Agnostique et réutilisable"],"de":["Integration mit Next.js und Sanity CMS","Anpassbares Design mit Tailwind CSS","Implementierung mit AWS Amplify","Anpassungstoken und Initialisierungsskript","Agnostisch und wiederverwendbar"],"pt":["Integração com Next.js","Suporte a Sanity CMS","Estilização com Tailwind CSS","Implantação com AWS Amplify","Personalização com tokens e script de inicialização"],"ru":["Интеграция с Next.js","Поддержка Sanity CMS","Стилизация с помощью Tailwind CSS","Развертывание с помощью AWS Amplify","Настройка с помощью токенов и скрипта инициализации"],"ar":["التكامل مع Next.js","دعم Sanity CMS","التشكيل مع Tailwind CSS","التحديث مع AWS Amplify","التعديل مع الرموز والعبارة الأولية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["程序化SEO","AI智能工具","Next.js","Sanity CMS","Tailwind CSS","AWS Amplify","SEO优化","开发效率","快速开发","高效SEO"],"ja":["プログラマティックSEO","AIエージェント","Next.js","Sanity CMS","Tailwind CSS","AWS Amplify","SEO最適化","開発効率","迅速な開発","効率的なSEO"],"ko":["프로그램적 SEO","AI 에이전트","Next.js","Sanity CMS","Tailwind CSS","AWS Amplify","SEO 최적화","개발 효율성","빠른 개발","효율적인 SEO"],"es":["programmatic-seo","Next.js","Sanity CMS","Tailwind CSS","AWS Amplify","herramientas de seo","optimización de motores de búsqueda","cómo utilizar programmatic-seo","guía de instalación de programmatic-seo"],"fr":["programmatic-seo","Next.js","Sanity CMS","Tailwind CSS","AWS Amplify","outils de seo","optimisation des moteurs de recherche","comment utiliser programmatic-seo","guide d''installation de programmatic-seo"],"de":["programmatic-seo","Next.js","Sanity CMS","Tailwind CSS","AWS Amplify","AI-Tools","Suchmaschinenoptimierung","wie man programmatic-seo verwendet","Installationsanleitung für programmatic-seo"],"pt":["como usar programmatic seo","o que é programmatic seo","alternativas para next.js","next.js vs gatsby","instalar programmatic seo","guia de configuração do programmatic seo"],"ru":["как использовать программную seo","что такое программная seo","альтернативы для next.js","next.js vs gatsby","установить программную seo","руководство по настройке программной seo"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام البرمجة seo","ما هو البرمجة seo","بديل ل next.js","next.js مقابل gatsby","تثبيت البرمجة seo","دليل إعداد البرمجة seo"]}},"owner":"AWS-Educate","repo":"template-nextjs-sanity-tailwind-amplify","repoPath":"AWS-Educate/template-nextjs-sanity-tailwind-amplify","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T18:09:35Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"programmatic-seo","description":"When the user wants to create SEO-driven pages at scale using templates and data. Also use when the user mentions programmatic SEO, template pages, pages at scale, directory pages, location pages, [keyword] + [city] pages, comparison pages, integration pages, or building many pages for SEO. For auditing existing SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Programmatic SEO\n\nYou are an expert in programmatic SEO—building SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data. Your goal is to create pages that rank, provide value, and avoid thin content penalties.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore designing a programmatic SEO strate","body":"# Programmatic SEO\n\nYou are an expert in programmatic SEO—building SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data. Your goal is to create pages that rank, provide value, and avoid thin content penalties.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore designing a programmatic SEO strategy, understand:\n\n1. **Business Context**\n   - What''s the product/service?\n   - Who is the target audience?\n   - What''s the conversion goal for these pages?\n\n2. **Opportunity Assessment**\n   - What search patterns exist?\n   - How many potential pages?\n   - What''s the search volume distribution?\n\n3. **Competitive Landscape**\n   - Who ranks for these terms now?\n   - What do their pages look like?\n   - Can you realistically compete?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Unique Value Per Page\n- Every page must provide value specific to that page\n- Not just swapped variables in a template\n- Maximize unique content—the more differentiated, the better\n\n### 2. Proprietary Data Wins\nHierarchy of data defensibility:\n1. Proprietary (you created it)\n2. Product-derived (from your users)\n3. User-generated (your community)\n4. Licensed (exclusive access)\n5. Public (anyone can use—weakest)\n\n### 3. Clean URL Structure\n**Always use subfolders, not subdomains**:\n- Good: `yoursite.com/templates/resume/`\n- Bad: `templates.yoursite.com/resume/`\n\n### 4. Genuine Search Intent Match\nPages must actually answer what people are searching for.\n\n### 5. Quality Over Quantity\nBetter to have 100 great pages than 10,000 thin ones.\n\n### 6. Avoid Google Penalties\n- No doorway pages\n- No keyword stuffing\n- No duplicate content\n- Genuine utility for users\n\n---\n\n## The 12 Playbooks (Overview)\n\n| Playbook | Pattern | Example |\n|----------|---------|---------|\n| Templates | \"[Type] template\" | \"resume template\" |\n| Curation | \"best [category]\" | \"best website builders\" |\n| Conversions | \"[X] to [Y]\" | \"$10 USD to GBP\" |\n| Comparisons | \"[X] vs [Y]\" | \"webflow vs wordpress\" |\n| Examples | \"[type] examples\" | \"landing page examples\" |\n| Locations | \"[service] in [location]\" | \"dentists in austin\" |\n| Personas | \"[product] for [audience]\" | \"crm for real estate\" |\n| Integrations | \"[product A] [product B] integration\" | \"slack asana integration\" |\n| Glossary | \"what is [term]\" | \"what is pSEO\" |\n| Translations | Content in multiple languages | Localized content |\n| Directory | \"[category] tools\" | \"ai copywriting tools\" |\n| Profiles | \"[entity name]\" | \"stripe ceo\" |\n\n**For detailed playbook implementation**: See [references/playbooks.md](references/playbooks.md)\n\n---\n\n## Choosing Your Playbook\n\n| If you have... | Consider... |\n|----------------|-------------|\n| Proprietary data | Directories, Profiles |\n| Product with integrations | Integrations |\n| Design/creative product | Templates, Examples |\n| Multi-segment audience | Personas |\n| Local presence | Locations |\n| Tool or utility product | Conversions |\n| Content/expertise | Glossary, Curation |\n| Competitor landscape | Comparisons |\n\nYou can layer multiple playbooks (e.g., \"Best coworking spaces in San Diego\").\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Framework\n\n### 1. Keyword Pattern Research\n\n**Identify the pattern:**\n- What''s the repeating structure?\n- What are the variables?\n- How many unique combinations exist?\n\n**Validate demand:**\n- Aggregate search volume\n- Volume distribution (head vs. long tail)\n- Trend direction\n\n### 2. Data Requirements\n\n**Identify data sources:**\n- What data populates each page?\n- Is it first-party, scraped, licensed, public?\n- How is it updated?\n\n### 3. Template Design\n\n**Page structure:**\n- Header with target keyword\n- Unique intro (not just variables swapped)\n- Data-driven sections\n- Related pages / internal links\n- CTAs appropriate to intent\n\n**Ensuring uniqueness:**\n- Each page needs unique value\n- Conditional content based on data\n- Original insights/analysis per page\n\n### 4. Internal Linking Architecture\n\n**Hub and spoke model:**\n- Hub: Main category page\n- Spokes: Individual programmatic pages\n- Cross-links between related spokes\n\n**Avoid orphan pages:**\n- Every page reachable from main site\n- XML sitemap for all pages\n- Breadcrumbs with structured data\n\n### 5. Indexation Strategy\n\n- Prioritize high-volume patterns\n- Noindex very thin variations\n- Manage crawl budget thoughtfully\n- Separate sitemaps by page type\n\n---\n\n## Quality Checks\n\n### Pre-Launch Checklist\n\n**Content quality:**\n- [ ] Each page provides unique value\n- [ ] Answers search intent\n- [ ] Readable and useful\n\n**Technical SEO:**\n- [ ] Unique titles and meta descriptions\n- [ ] Proper heading structure\n- [ ] Schema markup implemented\n- [ ] Page speed acceptable\n\n**Internal linking:**\n- [ ] Connected to site architecture\n- [ ] Related pages linked\n- [ ] No orphan pages\n\n**Indexation:**\n- [ ] In XML sitemap\n- [ ] Crawlable\n- [ ] No conflicting noindex\n\n### Post-Launch Monitoring\n\nTrack: Indexation rate, Rankings, Traffic, Engagement, Conversion\n\nWatch for: Thin content warnings, Ranking drops, Manual actions, Crawl errors\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- **Thin content**: Just swapping city names in identical content\n- **Keyword cannibalization**: Multiple pages targeting same keyword\n- **Over-generation**: Creating pages with no search demand\n- **Poor data quality**: Outdated or incorrect information\n- **Ignoring UX**: Pages exist for Google, not users\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Strategy Document\n- Opportunity analysis\n- Implementation plan\n- Content guidelines\n\n### Page Template\n- URL structure\n- Title/meta templates\n- Content outline\n- Schema markup\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What keyword patterns are you targeting?\n2. What data do you have (or can acquire)?\n3. How many pages are you planning?\n4. What does your site authority look like?\n5. Who currently ranks for these terms?\n6. What''s your technical stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For auditing programmatic pages after launch\n- **schema-markup**: For adding structured data\n- **competitor-alternatives**: For comparison page frameworks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T03:13:34.197Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced programmatic SEO capabilities to build scalable, SEO-optimized pages using templates and data","zh":"非常适合需要高级程序化SEO功能的AI代理，以使用模板和数据构建可扩展、SEO优化的页面","ja":"高度なプログラムによるSEO機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適で、テンプレートとデータを使用してスケーラブルでSEO最適化されたページを構築する","ko":"고급 프로그래매틱 SEO 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 템플릿과 데이터를 사용하여 확장 가능하고 SEO 최적화된 페이지를 구축하는 데 사용","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de SEO programáticas avanzadas para construir páginas escalables y optimizadas para SEO utilizando plantillas y datos","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des capacités de SEO programmatiques avancées pour créer des pages escalables et optimisées pour le SEO à l''aide de modèles et de données","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte programmatische SEO-Fähigkeiten benötigen, um skalierbare, SEO-optimierte Seiten mit Vorlagen und Daten zu erstellen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de SEO programático para construir páginas escaláveis e otimizadas para SEO usando modelos e dados","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности программного SEO для создания масштабируемых, оптимизированных для SEO страниц с использованием шаблонов и данных","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة في تحسين محركات البحث البرمجي لبناء صفحات قابلة للتطوير ومحسنة لتحسين محركات البحث باستخدام القوالب والبيانات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate SEO-optimized pages at scale using Next.js, Sanity CMS, and Tailwind CSS, providing a robust foundation for programmatic SEO strategies with AWS Amplify and reusable templates","zh":"赋予代理生成大规模SEO优化页面的能力，使用Next.js、Sanity CMS和Tailwind CSS，提供了AWS Amplify和可重用模板的坚实基础，用于程序化SEO策略","ja":"Next.js、Sanity CMS、Tailwind CSSを使用して、大規模なSEO最適化ページを生成するエージェントの能力を提供し、AWS Amplifyと再利用可能なテンプレートの堅実な基盤を提供して、プログラムによるSEO戦略を実現","ko":"Next.js, Sanity CMS 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 대규모 SEO 최적화 페이지를 생성하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, AWS Amplify 및 재사용 가능한 템플릿의 견고한基础를 제공하여 프로그래매틱 SEO 전략을 실현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar páginas optimizadas para SEO a gran escala utilizando Next.js, Sanity CMS y Tailwind CSS, proporcionando una base sólida para estrategias de SEO programáticas con AWS Amplify y plantillas reutilizables","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des pages optimisées pour le SEO à grande échelle en utilisant Next.js, Sanity CMS et Tailwind CSS, fournissant une base solide pour les stratégies de SEO programmatiques avec AWS Amplify et des modèles réutilisables","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, SEO-optimierte Seiten im großen Maßstab mit Next.js, Sanity CMS und Tailwind CSS zu erstellen, wodurch eine solide Grundlage für programmatische SEO-Strategien mit AWS Amplify und wiederverwendbaren Vorlagen geschaffen wird","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerar páginas otimizadas para SEO em escala usando Next.js, Sanity CMS e Tailwind CSS, fornecendo uma base robusta para estratégias de SEO programático com AWS Amplify e modelos reutilizáveis","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать оптимизированные для SEO страницы в масштабе с использованием Next.js, Sanity CMS и Tailwind CSS, обеспечивая надежную основу для стратегий программного SEO с AWS Amplify и многоразовыми шаблонами","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء صفحات محسنة لتحسين محركات البحث على نطاق واسع باستخدام Next.js وSanity CMS وTailwind CSS، مما يوفر أساسًا قويًا لإستراتيجيات تحسين محركات البحث البرمجي مع AWS Amplify والقوالب القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating page generation for e-commerce products","Generating SEO-optimized landing pages for marketing campaigns","Creating scalable, data-driven content hubs"],"zh":["自动化电子商务产品的页面生成","为营销活动生成SEO优化的着陆页","创建可扩展、数据驱动的内容中心"],"ja":["電子商取引製品のページ生成の自動化","マーケティングキャンペーンのSEO最適化されたランディングページの生成","拡張可能でデータ駆動のコンテンツハブの作成"],"ko":["전자상거래 제품의 페이지 생성 자동화","마케팅 캠페인용 SEO 최적화된 랜딩 페이지 생성","확장 가능하고 데이터 驅動의 콘텐츠 허브 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de páginas para productos de comercio electrónico","Generación de páginas de destino optimizadas para SEO para campañas de marketing","Creación de centros de contenido impulsados por datos y escalables"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de pages pour les produits de commerce électronique","Génération de pages de destination optimisées pour le SEO pour les campagnes de marketing","Création de hubs de contenu alimentés par des données et escalables"],"de":["Automatisierung der Seitenerstellung für E-Commerce-Produkte","Erstellung von SEO-optimierten Landingpages für Marketingkampagnen","Erstellung von datengetriebenen und skalierbaren Content-Hubs"],"pt":["Automatização da geração de páginas para produtos de e-commerce","Geração de páginas de destino otimizadas para SEO para campanhas de marketing","Criação de hubs de conteúdo escaláveis e orientados por dados"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания страниц для товаров электронной коммерции","Генерация оптимизированных для SEO целевых страниц для маркетинговых кампаний","Создание масштабируемых, управляемых данными контент-хабов"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء الصفحات لمنتجات التجارة الإلكترونية","إنشاء صفحات مقصودة محسنة لتحسين محركات البحث للحملات التسويقية","إنشاء مراكز محتوى قابلة للتطوير وقائمة على البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Sanity CMS and AWS Amplify setup","Next.js and Tailwind CSS expertise recommended","Customization limited by template structure and placeholder tokens"],"zh":["需要Sanity CMS和AWS Amplify设置","建议具有Next.js和Tailwind CSS专业知识","自定义受模板结构和占位符令牌限制"],"ja":["Sanity CMSとAWS Amplifyの設定が必要","Next.jsとTailwind CSSの専門知識が推奨される","カスタマイズはテンプレート構造とプレイスホルダトークンによって制限される"],"ko":["Sanity CMS 및 AWS Amplify 설정 필요","Next.js 및 Tailwind CSS 전문 지식 권장","고객 맞춤화는 템플릿 구조 및 플레이스 홀더 토큰에 의해 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Sanity CMS y AWS Amplify","Se recomienda experiencia en Next.js y Tailwind CSS","La personalización está limitada por la estructura de la plantilla y los tokens de marcador de posición"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Sanity CMS et d''AWS Amplify","Une expertise en Next.js et Tailwind CSS est recommandée","La personnalisation est limitée par la structure du modèle et les jetons de marqueur de position"],"de":["Benötigt Sanity CMS- und AWS Amplify-Setup","Next.js- und Tailwind CSS-Expertise wird empfohlen","Anpassung ist durch Vorlagenstruktur und Platzhalter-Tokens eingeschränkt"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Sanity CMS e AWS Amplify","Recomenda-se experiência em Next.js e Tailwind CSS","A personalização é limitada pela estrutura do modelo e pelos tokens de espaço reservado"],"ru":["Требует настройки Sanity CMS и AWS Amplify","Рекомендуется опыт работы с Next.js и Tailwind CSS","Настройка ограничена структурой шаблона и токенами-заполнителями"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Sanity CMS وAWS Amplify","يوصى بوجود خبرة في Next.js وTailwind CSS","تكون التخصيص محدودة بهيكل القالب ورموز العناصر النائبة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0602e928f430986fa712a31335c915c4b594f51dfbef122e01304b855d724f75","qualityScore":55}');
