INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('AWS-Educate/template-nextjs-sanity-tailwind-amplify/programmatic-seo', 'programmatic-seo', 'AWS-Educate', 'template-nextjs-sanity-tailwind-amplify', 'community', 'programmatic-seo AWS-Educate template-nextjs-sanity-tailwind-amplify community 程序化SEO解决方案，使用Next.js、Sanity CMS、Tailwind CSS和AWS Amplify，提供快速开发和高效的SEO优化。 プログラマティックSEOソリューション、Next.js、Sanity CMS、Tailwind CSS、AWS Amplifyを使用して、迅速な開発と効率的なSEO最適化を提供。 프로그램적 SEO 솔루션, Next.js, Sanity CMS, Tailwind CSS 및 AWS Amplify를 사용하여 빠른 개발과 효율적인 SEO 최적화를 제공합니다. Plantilla de inicio para programmatic-seo con Next.js, Sanity CMS, Tailwind CSS y AWS Amplify, lista para personalizar Modèle de démarrage pour programmatic-seo avec Next.js, Sanity CMS, Tailwind CSS et AWS Amplify, prêt à personnaliser Startvorlage für programmatic-seo mit Next.js, Sanity CMS, Tailwind CSS und AWS Amplify, bereit für die Anpassung O Programmatic SEO é um modelo de inicialização para Next.js com Sanity CMS, Tailwind CSS e AWS Amplify, pronto para personalização. Программная SEO - это стартовый шаблон для Next.js с Sanity CMS, Tailwind CSS и AWS Amplify, готовый к настройке. البرمجة SEO هي قالب ابتدائي ل Next.js مع Sanity CMS و Tailwind CSS و AWS Amplify، جاهز للتعديل. 🚀 Starter template: Next.js (App Router) + Sanity CMS + Tailwind CSS + AWS Amplify. Agnostic, reusable, and ready to customize with {{PLACEHOLDER}} tokens and init script. 程序化SEO AI智能工具 Next.js Sanity CMS Tailwind CSS AWS Amplify SEO优化 开发效率 快速开发 高效SEO 🚀 Starter template: Next.js (App Router) + Sanity CMS + Tailwind CSS + AWS Amplify. Agnostic, reusable, and ready to customize with {{PLACEHOLDER}} tokens and init script.');
